Commercial and industrial districts covered, with the same brand range and support as Dubai and Abu Dhabi.                    </div>\n                                    </div>\n\n                                <div class=\"elementskit-box-footer\">\n                    <div class=\"box-footer\">\n                        <div class=\"btn-wraper\">\n                                                            <a href=\"#\" class=\"elementskit-btn whitespace--normal\">\n\n                                    \n                                    Learn more                                 </a>\n                                                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                            </div>\n            </div>\n    </div>				</div>\n				</div>\n				</div>\n				</div>\n					</div>\n				</div>\n		<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4495242 e-flex e-con-boxed wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no wpr-column-slider-no wpr-equal-height-no e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"4495242\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n					<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n		<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3af81de e-con-full e-flex wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no wpr-column-slider-no wpr-equal-height-no e-con e-child\" data-id=\"3af81de\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e30a022 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"e30a022\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n					<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Don\'t Let a Power Cut Stop Your Site.<br>\nGet a Rental Generator On-Site — Fast.</h2>				</div>\n				</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bbadfd0 elementor-align-left elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-button\" data-id=\"bbadfd0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"elementskit-button.default\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n					<div class=\"ekit-wid-con\" >		<div class=\"ekit-btn-wraper\">\n							<a href=\"tel:+971%2056%20921%203754\" class=\"elementskit-btn  whitespace--normal\" id=\"\">\n					+971 56 921 3754				</a>\n					</div>\n        </div>				</div>\n				</div>\n				</div>\n					</div>\n				</div>\n				</div>\n		','http://localhost:8000/storage/media/rental-power.webp','default','published','About Us - Rental Power and Rental Cooling in UAE','our rental generators and chiller units deliver efficient, fast cooling wherever it\'s needed. we offer all over in dubai uae.',NULL,'https://rentalpower.ae/about/','About Us - Rental Power and Rental Cooling in UAE','our rental generators and chiller units deliver efficient, fast cooling wherever it\'s needed. we offer all over in dubai uae.','http://localhost:8000/storage/media/rental-power.webp',1,'about us uae',94,100,'2026-10-17 04:49:54','2026-10-18 02:18:08',NULL),(104,1,'Portable Generator Rental in UAE','products/portable-generator','<p dir=\"ltr\">A portable generator is a small, movable power source you can set up almost anywhere — a job that a large fixed generator would be far too big for. Light enough to carry or wheel into place, it runs power tools, lighting, market stalls, event stands, or acts as backup for a shop or home. Most portable units run on petrol and are quiet enough for public and residential areas. For any UAE job that needs modest, movable power fast, this is the equipment to reach for.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">What Makes This Equipment Different?</h2>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">The difference is size and mobility, not just output. Where our <a href=\"/products/heavy-duty-industrial-generator/\">larger generators</a> are heavy plant that need a crane and a truck, a portable unit is built to be moved by hand or on its own wheels and started with a pull cord or a key.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Most portables run on petrol rather than diesel, which keeps them light and quiet — many run at around 58–65 dB, close to normal conversation, so they suit events, shops and homes where noise matters. They give single-phase 230V power, the same as a normal wall socket, so they&#8217;re ideal for tools, lighting and everyday electronics rather than heavy three-phase machinery.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">They&#8217;re also simple: fill the tank, pull the cord, and you have power. No site preparation, no crane, no cabling crew.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">Key Specifications</h2>\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"col\">Specification</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Capacity range</td>\n<td>~1 kVA to ~15 kVA</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fuel</td>\n<td>Petrol (small units) or diesel (larger units)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Voltage</td>\n<td>230V single-phase (three-phase available on larger diesel units)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Frequency</td>\n<td>50 Hz</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Starting</td>\n<td>Recoil (pull-cord) or electric start</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Noise level</td>\n<td>~58–65 dB on quiet petrol units</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Runtime</td>\n<td>Up to ~8 hours per tank, depending on load</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mobility</td>\n<td>Carry handles or built-in wheel kit</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Brands</td>\n<td>Honda (petrol) and diesel options</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">Available Capacities / Options</h2>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Portable units are chosen by how much you need to run and how quiet it must be:</p>\n<ul dir=\"ltr\">\n<li><strong>Small petrol (around 1–3 kVA)</strong> — for a few tools, lighting, laptops, or a market stall. Light enough for one person to carry.</li>\n<li><strong>Mid petrol (around 4–7 kVA)</strong> — for a busier stand, a small shop backup, or several tools at once. Usually on wheels.</li>\n<li><strong>Small diesel (around 5–15 kVA)</strong> — for longer runs and heavier continuous use; larger units can give three-phase power.</li>\n<li><strong>Paired units</strong> — some petrol models can be linked together to give more power when you need it, then split again for smaller jobs.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">Key Features</h2>\n<ul dir=\"ltr\">\n<li>Light and movable — carried by hand or rolled on a built-in wheel kit</li>\n<li>Quiet petrol units (~58–65 dB) suited to events, shops and homes</li>\n<li>Single-phase 230V, the same as a normal socket — ready for tools, lighting and electronics</li>\n<li>Simple pull-cord or electric start; no crane, cabling crew or site prep</li>\n<li>Around 8 hours of running on one tank</li>\n<li>Clean, stable power on inverter models — safe for laptops and sensitive electronics</li>\n<li>Serviced and tested before every rental</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">Applications</h2>\n<ul dir=\"ltr\">\n<li><strong>Events, stalls and exhibitions</strong> — quiet power for stands, lighting and catering points</li>\n<li><strong>Small construction and maintenance jobs</strong> — drills, grinders, saws and site lighting</li>\n<li><strong>Shops and offices</strong> — short-term backup to stay open through a power cut</li>\n<li><strong>Film, photography and outdoor functions</strong> — clean, quiet power away from the grid</li>\n<li><strong>Remote or temporary spots</strong> — anywhere a fixed supply isn&#8217;t practical</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">Rental Availability in UAE</h2>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Rental Power supplies portable generators for short-term and long-term hire across Dubai, Abu Dhabi, Sharjah and the wider UAE, delivered ready to run. For larger three-phase loads beyond what a portable can carry, this equipment sits within our broader <a href=\"/services/generator/rental-generator-in-uae/\">rental generator in UAE</a> range, so we can move you up to a bigger set whenever the job needs it.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">Choosing the Right Option</h2>\n<ul dir=\"ltr\">\n<li><strong>Add up what you&#8217;ll run</strong> — total the wattage of your tools or equipment, and allow extra for anything with a motor that surges on start-up.</li>\n<li><strong>Petrol vs. diesel</strong> — petrol is lighter and quieter for short jobs; diesel suits longer, heavier running.</li>\n<li><strong>Noise limits</strong> — for events, hotels and residential areas, choose a quiet inverter petrol unit.</li>\n<li><strong>Sensitive electronics</strong> — if you&#8217;re running laptops, cameras or audio, ask for an inverter model for clean power.</li>\n<li><strong>Runtime</strong> — for long days, a larger tank or a <a href=\"/products/diesel-generator/\">diesel unit</a> means fewer refills.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">FAQs</h2>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>What can a portable generator run?</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Tools, lighting, a market stall, electronics, or short-term backup for a shop or home — anything on a normal single-phase supply. For heavy three-phase machinery you&#8217;ll need a larger set.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Are portable generators quiet enough for events?</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Yes — quiet petrol inverter units run at around 58–65 dB, close to normal conversation, which suits events, hotels and residential areas.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Petrol or diesel &#8211; which portable should I hire?</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Petrol units are lighter and quieter for short jobs; small diesel units suit longer, heavier running. Tell us the job and we&#8217;ll match it.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>How long does a portable generator run on one tank?</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Up to around 8 hours depending on load. Lighter loads run longer; we can also plan refuelling for longer jobs.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Can I get more power from a portable generator?</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Some petrol models can be linked together for extra output. If you need more than that, we&#8217;ll move you up to a larger single-phase or three-phase set.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\"></h2>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Tell us what you need to run and where, and we&#8217;ll confirm the right portable generator and a rental quotation. Call <a href=\"tel:+971 56 921 3754\"><strong>+971 56 921 3754</strong></a> for availability across the UAE.</p>\n','http://localhost:8000/storage/media/pota-geeee.jpg','default','published','Portable Generator Rental UAE | Rental Power Hire','Portable generator rental across the UAE - small, movable petrol & diesel units for events, shops. Delivered in Dubai, Abu Dhabi & Sharjah.',NULL,'https://rentalpower.ae/products/portable-generator/','Portable Generator Rental UAE | Rental Power Hire','Portable generator rental across the UAE - small, movable petrol & diesel units for events, shops. Delivered in Dubai, Abu Dhabi & Sharjah.','http://localhost:8000/storage/media/pota-geeee.jpg',1,'portable generator rental in uae',91,100,'2026-10-17 04:49:54','2026-10-18 02:18:08',NULL),(105,1,'Portable Generator Rental in UAE','portable-generator','<p dir=\"ltr\">A portable generator is a small, movable power source you can set up almost anywhere — a job that a large fixed generator would be far too big for. Light enough to carry or wheel into place, it runs power tools, lighting, market stalls, event stands, or acts as backup for a shop or home. Most portable units run on petrol and are quiet enough for public and residential areas. For any UAE job that needs modest, movable power fast, this is the equipment to reach for.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">What Makes This Equipment Different?</h2>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">The difference is size and mobility, not just output. Where our <a href=\"/products/heavy-duty-industrial-generator/\">larger generators</a> are heavy plant that need a crane and a truck, a portable unit is built to be moved by hand or on its own wheels and started with a pull cord or a key.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\