ined load of tools, lighting, and equipment on-site, including startup surge for motorized equipment. Our team can help calculate the right capacity based on your equipment list.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Do diesel generators need refuelling during a rental period?</strong><br />\nYes, for extended deployments — refuelling frequency depends on tank size and load, and can be arranged as part of an ongoing rental.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Can I rent a diesel generator with a soundproof enclosure?</strong><br />\nSoundproof (canopied) enclosures are a standard configuration offered across most capacity ranges, alongside open-type units for sites where noise isn&#8217;t a concern. Confirm availability for your specific capacity when requesting a quote.</p>\n','http://localhost:8000/storage/media/diesel-generator.jpg','default','published','Diesel Generator Rental UAE | Rental Power','Diesel generators for hire in UAE. Reliable power for construction and industrial needs. Get a quote from Rental Power.',NULL,'https://rentalpower.ae/products/diesel-generator/','Diesel Generator Rental UAE | Rental Power','Diesel generators for hire in UAE. Reliable power for construction and industrial needs. Get a quote from Rental Power.','http://localhost:8000/storage/media/diesel-generator.jpg',1,'diesel generator rental in uae',91,100,'2026-10-17 04:49:54','2026-10-18 02:18:09',NULL),(112,1,'Generator & Chiller Rental Equipment','products','','/storage/media/rental-generator.webp','default','published','Generator & Chiller Rental Equipment Catalog | Rental Power','Browse Rental Power\'s full catalog of generators and chillers available for rent across the UAE. Reliable power and cooling equipment for construction, events, and industrial projects.',NULL,'https://rentalpower.ae/products/','Generator & Chiller Rental Equipment Catalog | Rental Power','Browse Rental Power\'s full catalog of generators and chillers available for rent across the UAE. Reliable power and cooling equipme