size-default\">What Is a Packaged AC Unit?</h2>				</div>\n				</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f0b2196 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f0b2196\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n									<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A packaged AC unit is a self-contained AC system rental option that houses the compressor, condenser, and evaporator together in a single outdoor cabinet, rather than splitting components between an indoor and outdoor unit. Conditioned air is distributed through ductwork connected to the space being cooled.</span></p><p> </p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This single-cabinet design is what makes packaged units so effective for large-scale temporary cooling: there&#8217;s no separate indoor unit to install, and a single package can serve a much larger area than a split system. HVAC package unit rental UAE clients typically choose this format specifically because it scales to whole-building or whole-tent cooling loads that smaller systems can&#8217;t handle.</span></p>								</div>\n				</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-09c756e elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-mobile-align-center elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"09c756e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n									<div class=\"elementor-button-wrapper\">\n					<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm\" href=\"/contact/\">\n						<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n									<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Contact us</span>\n					</span>\n					</a>\n				</div>\n								</div>\n				</div>\n				</div>\n					</div>\n				</div>\n		<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d145d3e e-flex e-con-boxed wpr-particle-no wpr-jarall