                        <!-- Active Icon -->\n										<i class=\"icon icon-up-arrow\"></i>                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n\n                            \n                                                    </a>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div id=\"Collapse-f566a246ad22da1041e4\" class=\" show collapse\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"primaryHeading-0-060f30c\" data-parent=\"#accordion-6ad22da1041e4\">\n\n                        <div class=\"elementskit-card-body ekit-accordion--content\">\n                            <p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">A packaged AC unit houses the compressor, condenser, and evaporator together in one outdoor cabinet, distributing cooled air through ductwork connected to the space. This differs from split systems, which separate components between indoor and outdoor units.</span></p>                        </div>\n\n                    </div>\n\n                </div><!-- .elementskit-card END -->\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-card \">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-card-header\" id=\"primaryHeading-1-060f30c\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\">\n                        <a href=\"#collapse-5f0aeec6ad22da1041e4\" class=\"ekit-accordion--toggler elementskit-btn-link collapsed\" role=\"button\" data-ekit-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#Collapse-5f0aeec6ad22da1041e4\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"Collapse-5f0aeec6ad22da1041e4\">\n                            \n                            <span class=\"ekit-accordion-title\">What tonnage of package AC do I need for my space?</span>\n\n                            \n                                <div class=\"ekit_accordion_icon_group\">\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_normal_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Normal Icon -->\n										<i class=\"icon icon-down-arrow1\"></i>                                    </div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_active_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Active Icon -->\n										<i class=\"icon icon-up-arrow\"></i>                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n\n                            \n                                                    </a>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div id=\"Collapse-5f0aeec6ad22da1041e4\" class=\" collapse\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"primaryHeading-1-060f30c\" data-parent=\"#accordion-6ad22da1041e4\">\n\n                        <div class=\"elementskit-card-body ekit-accordion--content\">\n                            <p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Tonnage depends on floor area, ceiling height, occupancy, and heat load from equipment. Our capacity guide above offers a starting point, but we recommend a free site assessment for an accurate recommendation.</span></p>                        </div>\n\n                    </div>\n\n                </div><!-- .elementskit-card END -->\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-card \">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-card-header\" id=\"primaryHeading-2-060f30c\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\">\n                        <a href=\"#collapse-828dca36ad22da1041e4\" class=\"ekit-accordion--toggler elementskit-btn-link collapsed\" role=\"button\" data-ekit-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#Collapse-828dca36ad22da1041e4\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"Collapse-828dca36ad22da1041e4\">\n                            \n                            <span class=\"ekit-accordion-title\">What&#039;s the difference between a packaged AC unit and a portable AC?</span>\n\n                            \n                                <div class=\"ekit_accordion_icon_group\">\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_normal_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Normal Icon -->\n										<i class=\"icon icon-down-arrow1\"></i>                                    </div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_active_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Active Icon -->\n										<i class=\"icon icon-up-arrow\"></i>                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n\n                            \n                                                    </a>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div id=\"Collapse-828dca36ad22da1041e4\" class=\" collapse\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"primaryHeading-2-060f30c\" data-parent=\"#accordion-6ad22da1041e4\">\n\n                        <div class=\"elementskit-card-body ekit-accordion--content\">\n                            <p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Packaged units offer far higher cooling capacity and require ducted installation, making them suited to large commercial and industrial spaces. Portable units are lower-capacity, plug-and-play systems better suited to small rooms or spot cooling.</span></p>                        </div>\n\n                    </div>\n\n                </div><!-- .elementskit-card END -->\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-card \">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-card-header\" id=\"primaryHeading-3-060f30c\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\">\n                        <a href=\"#collapse-081c40d6ad22da1041e4\" class=\"ekit-accordion--toggler elementskit-btn-link collapsed\" role=\"button\" data-ekit-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#Collapse-081c40d6ad22da1041e4\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"Collapse-081c40d6ad22da1041e4\">\n                            \n                            <span class=\"ekit-accordion-title\">Can I rent a rooftop package AC unit for a short-term event?</span>\n\n                            \n                                <div class=\"ekit_accordion_icon_group\">\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_normal_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Normal Icon -->\n										<i class=\"icon icon-down-arrow1\"></i>                                    </div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_active_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Active Icon -->\n										<i class=\"icon icon-up-arrow\"></i>                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n\n                            \n                                                    </a>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div id=\"Collapse-081c40d6ad22da1041e4\" class=\" collapse\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"primaryHeading-3-060f30c\" data-parent=\"#accordion-6ad22da1041e4\">\n\n                        <div class=\"elementskit-card-body ekit-accordion--content\">\n                            <p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Yes. Package units are available on short-term rental terms for events and exhibitions, with ground-mounted setups typically used where rooftop access isn\'t available at the venue.</span></p>                        </div>\n\n                    </div>\n\n                </div><!-- .elementskit-card END -->\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-card \">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-card-header\" id=\"primaryHeading-4-060f30c\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\">\n                        <a href=\"#collapse-d6f467a6ad22da1041e4\" class=\"ekit-accordion--toggler elementskit-btn-link collapsed\" role=\"button\" data-ekit-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#Collapse-d6f467a6ad22da1041e4\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"Collapse-d6f467a6ad22da1041e4\">\n                            \n                            <span class=\"ekit-accordion-title\">How quickly can you install a package AC rental unit?</span>\n\n                            \n                                <div class=\"ekit_accordion_icon_group\">\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_normal_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Normal Icon -->\n										<i class=\"icon icon-down-arrow1\"></i>                                    </div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_active_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Active Icon -->\n										<i class=\"icon icon-up-arrow\"></i>                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n\n                            \n                                                    </a>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div id=\"Collapse-d6f467a6ad22da1041e4\" class=\" collapse\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"primaryHeading-4-060f30c\" data-parent=\"#accordion-6ad22da1041e4\">\n\n                        <div class=\"elementskit-card-body ekit-accordion--content\">\n                            <p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Installation timelines depend on unit tonnage, ducting requirements, and site access, but our teams are set up for fast turnaround across Dubai and the wider UAE, including expedited response for urgent cooling needs.</span></p>                        </div>\n\n                    </div>\n\n                </div><!-- .elementskit-card END -->\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-card \">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-card-header\" id=\"primaryHeading-5-060f30c\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\">\n                        <a href=\"#collapse-f44603d6ad22da1041e4\" class=\"ekit-accordion--toggler elementskit-btn-link collapsed\" role=\"button\" data-ekit-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#Collapse-f44603d6ad22da1041e4\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"Collapse-f44603d6ad22da1041e4\">\n                            \n                            <span class=\"ekit-accordion-title\">Can I rent a 10 ton package AC unit for construction site cooling?</span>