d capacities for construction site offices and mid-size cooling needs, and is available on both short-term and long-term terms.</span></p>\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What happens if the unit needs servicing during my rental period? \",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400\\\"> Our technical support team handles servicing and troubleshooting throughout the rental term as part of the service, so you won\'t need to arrange third-party maintenance.</span></p>\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can I upgrade to a larger tonnage mid-rental if my needs change?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400\\\">yes. If your cooling requirements grow during the rental period, our team can arrange a capacity upgrade to match your changing needs.</span></p>\"}}]}</script>\n                                </div>\n    </div>				</div>\n				</div>\n					</div>\n				</div>\n		<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-175a821 e-flex e-con-boxed wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no wpr-column-slider-no wpr-equal-height-no e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"175a821\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n					<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n		<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1ffbaca e-con-full e-flex wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no wpr-column-slider-no wpr-equal-height-no e-con e-child\" data-id=\"1ffbaca\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3b7e7d8 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"3b7e7d8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n					<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elem