      </div>\n\n                    <div id=\"Collapse-4c561786ad22da1041e4\" class=\" collapse\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"primaryHeading-6-060f30c\" data-parent=\"#accordion-6ad22da1041e4\">\n\n                        <div class=\"elementskit-card-body ekit-accordion--content\">\n                            <p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\"> Our technical support team handles servicing and troubleshooting throughout the rental term as part of the service, so you won\'t need to arrange third-party maintenance.</span></p>                        </div>\n\n                    </div>\n\n                </div><!-- .elementskit-card END -->\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-card \">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-card-header\" id=\"primaryHeading-7-060f30c\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\">\n                        <a href=\"#collapse-4e7f5cc6ad22da1041e4\" class=\"ekit-accordion--toggler elementskit-btn-link collapsed\" role=\"button\" data-ekit-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#Collapse-4e7f5cc6ad22da1041e4\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"Collapse-4e7f5cc6ad22da1041e4\">\n                            \n                            <span class=\"ekit-accordion-title\">Can I upgrade to a larger tonnage mid-rental if my needs change?</span>\n\n                            \n                                <div class=\"ekit_accordion_icon_group\">\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_normal_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Normal Icon -->\n										<i class=\"icon icon-down-arrow1\"></i>                                    </div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_active_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Active Icon -->\n										<i class=\"icon icon-up-arrow\"></i>                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n\n                            \n                                                    </a>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div id=\"Collapse-4e7f5cc6ad22da1041e4\" class=\" collapse\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"primaryHeading-7-060f30c\" data-parent=\"#accordion-6ad22da1041e4\">\n\n                        <div class=\"elementskit-card-body ekit-accordion--content\">\n                            <p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">yes. If your cooling requirements grow during the rental period, our team can arrange a capacity upgrade to match your changing needs.</span></p>                        </div>\n\n                    </div>\n\n                </div><!-- .elementskit-card END -->\n\n                                                        <script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is a packaged AC unit and how does it work?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400\\\">A packaged AC unit houses the compressor, condenser, and evaporator together in one outdoor cabinet, distributing cooled air through ductwork connected to the space. This differs from split systems, which separate components between indoor and outdoor units.</span></p>\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What tonnage of package AC do I need for my space?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400\\\">Tonnage depends on floor area, ceiling height, occupancy, and heat load from equipment. Our capacity guide above offers a starting point, but we recommend a free site assessment for an accurate recommendation.</span></p>\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What&#039;s the difference between a packaged AC unit and a portable AC?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400\\\">Packaged units offer far higher cooling capacity and require ducted installation, making them suited to large com