</div>\n					</div>\n				</div>\n		<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d2224ac e-flex e-con-boxed wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no wpr-column-slider-no wpr-equal-height-no e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"d2224ac\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n					<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n		<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ad8871b e-con-full e-flex wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no wpr-column-slider-no wpr-equal-height-no e-con e-child\" data-id=\"ad8871b\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-34c9473 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"34c9473\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n					<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Portacabin Sizes &amp; Specifications Guide</h2>				</div>\n				</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-270bbfe elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"270bbfe\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n									<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Choosing the right size depends on intended use, occupancy, and available site footprint. As a general reference:</span></p>								</div>\n				</div>\n				</div>\n		<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5114a8e e-con-full e-flex wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no wpr-column-slider-no wpr-equal-height-no e-con e-child\" data-id=\"5114a8e\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0eb66ad elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"0eb66ad\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n									<table class=\"min-w-full border-collapse text-sm leading-[1.7] whitespace-normal\"><thead class=\"text-left\"><tr><th class=\"text-text-100 border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.6)] py-2 pr-4 align-top font-bold\" scope=\"col\">Size (approx.)</th><th class=\"text-text-100 border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.6)] py-2 pr-4 align-top font-bold\" scope=\"col\">Floor Area</th><th class=\"text-text-100 border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.6)] py-2 pr-4 align-top font-bold\" scope=\"col\">Typical Use Case</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=\"border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top\">10 x 8 ft</td><td class=\"border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top\">~7 m²</td><td class=\"border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top\">Security booth, guard room</td></tr><tr><td class=\"border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top\">16 x 8 ft</td><td class=\"border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top\">~12 m²</td><td class=\"border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top\">Single-person office, small store</td></tr><tr><td class=\"border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top\">20 x 8 ft</td><td class=\"border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top\">~15 m²</td><td class=\"border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top\">Standard site office, reception</td></tr><tr><td class=\"border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top\">24 x 10 ft</td><td class=\"border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top\">~22 m²</td><td class=\"border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top\">Office with meeting area, accommodation unit</td></tr><tr><td class=\"border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top\">32 x 10 ft</td><td class=\"border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top\">~29 m²</td><td class=\"border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top\">Manager&#8217;s office, clinic room</td></tr><tr><td class=\"border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top\">40 x 10 ft</td><td class=\"border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top\">~37 m²</td><td class=\"border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top\">Conference room, canteen, large open office</td></tr></tbody></table>								</div>\n				</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0815df7 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"0815df7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n									<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">For projects needing more floor area than a single unit provides, double-story stacked configurations and linked multi-unit setups are both available, letting you scale capacity without a custom manufacturing run. Our team can advise on the right configuration once we understand your space and occupancy requirements.</span></p>								</div>\n				</div>\n				</div>\n					</div>\n				</div>\n		<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7fcf15b e-flex e-con-boxed wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no wpr-column-slider-no wpr-equal-height-no e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"7fcf15b\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n					<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n		<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4487d20 e-con-full e-flex wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no wpr-column-slider-no wpr-equal-height-no e-con e-child\" data-id=\"4487d20\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-635a9ed elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"635a9ed\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n					<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">How Much Does a Portacabin Cost in UAE?</h2>				</div>\n				</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2261e19 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"2261e19\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n									<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Portacabin pricing in UAE depends on condition, size, and specification, and understanding the main cost drivers helps you get an accurate quote faster.</span></p><h3><b>New Portacabin Pricing Factors</b></h3><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">New unit pricing is driven primarily by size, the level of customization requested (electrical fit-out, insulation grade, interior finish), and manufacturing lead time. A fully custom-specified unit costs more than a standard configuration built to an existing template.</span></p><p> </p><h3><b>Used &amp; Refurbished Portacabin Pricing Factors</b></h3><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Used and refurbished pricing is driven by condition, age, and the extent of any restoration work carried out before resale. A refurbished unit typically costs more than an equivalent used unit, reflecting the inspection and repair work already completed on it</span></p>								</div>\n				</div>\n				</div>\n		<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-eed056c e-con-full e-flex wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no wpr-column-slider-no wpr-equal-height-no e-con e-child\" data-id=\"eed056c\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fba8c73 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"fba8c73\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n									<p><b>What affects the final price:</b></p><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Unit size and floor area</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Condition (new, used, or refurbished)</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Customization (electrical, plumbing, interior finish, partitions)</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Delivery distance from our depot to your site</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Installation complexity (single unit vs. multi-unit or double-story configuration)</span></li></ul>								</div>\n				</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9329497 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"9329497\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n									<div class=\"elementor-button-wrapper\">\n					<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm\" href=\"/contact/\">\n						<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n									<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Contact us</span>\n					</span>\n					</a>\n				</div>\n								</div>\n				</div>\n				</div>\n					</div>\n				</div>\n		<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6936e73 e-flex e-con-boxed wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no wpr-column-slider-no wpr-equal-height-no e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"6936e73\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n					<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n		<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ed71ffa e-con-full e-flex wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no wpr-column-slider-no wpr-equal-height-no e-con e-child\" data-id=\"ed71ffa\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0a498f2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"0a498f2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n					<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Buy a Portacabin: How It Works</h2>				</div>\n				</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6430aac elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"6430aac\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n									<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Buying through Rental Power follows a clear process from first enquiry to delivery.</span></p>								</div>\n				</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2982362 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"2982362\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n															<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\" src=\"http://localhost:8000/storage/media/portacabin-buyer-in-uae.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-3967\" alt=\"portacabin buyer in uae\" srcset=\"http://localhost:8000/storage/media/portacabin-buyer-in-uae.jpg 640w, /storage/media/2026/08/portacabin-buyer-in-uae-300x225.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" />															</div>\n				</div>\n				</div>\n		<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e8e04f6 e-con-full e-flex wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no wpr-column-slider-no wpr-equal-height-no e-con e-child\" data-id=\"e8e04f6\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-677b456 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"677b456\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n									<p> </p><ol><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Tell Us Your Requirement.</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> We start by understanding your intended use, timeline, and budget, whether you&#8217;re after a single security cabin or a multi-unit accommodation setup.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Browse Available Stock.</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> We show you what&#8217;s available across new, used, and refurbished categories that match your requirement, so you can compare condition and price directly.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Site Assessment.</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Where needed, our team checks your site&#8217;s access, ground conditions, and power supply to confirm the right unit and installation approach before anything is finalised.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Quote &amp; Agreement.</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> You receive a transparent quote covering unit cost, delivery, and any installation work, with clear terms before you commit.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Delivery &amp; Installation.</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Our team delivers and installs the unit, checking it&#8217;s positioned and connected correctly before handover.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>After-Sale Support.</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> If anything needs attention after delivery, whether it&#8217;s a servicing question or a customization request, our team remains available to help.</span></li></ol>								</div>\n				</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0b83289 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"0b83289\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n									<div class=\"elementor-button-wrapper\">\n					<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm\" href=\"/contact/\">\n						<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n									<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Contact us</span>\n					</span>\n					</a>\n				</div>\n								</div>\n				</div>\n				</div>\n					</div>\n				</div>\n		<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c682edb e-flex e-con-boxed wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no wpr-column-slider-no wpr-equal-height-no e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"c682edb\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n					<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n		<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-83acb79 e-con-full e-flex wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no wpr-column-slider-no wpr-equal-height-no e-con e-child\" data-id=\"83acb79\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6e8655c elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"6e8655c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n					<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Sell Your Portacabin: How It Works</h2>				</div>\n				</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-77e4404 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"77e4404\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n									<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If you have a portacabin you no longer need, whether a project has wrapped up or you&#8217;re upgrading to a different unit, selling through Rental Power is a straightforward process built around a fair valuation and a fast turnaround.</span></p>								</div>\n				</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cb75750 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"cb75750\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n															<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"732\" src=\"/storage/media/2026/08/portacabin-sell-in-uae-1024x732.webp\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-3968\" alt=\"Portacabin Sizes and Configurations Available in UAE\" srcset=\"/storage/media/2026/08/portacabin-sell-in-uae-1024x732.webp 1024w, /storage/media/2026/08/portacabin-sell-in-uae-300x214.webp 300w, /storage/media/2026/08/portacabin-sell-in-uae-768x549.webp 768w, /storage/media/2026/08/portacabin-sell-in-uae-1536x1097.webp 1536w, /storage/media/2026/08/portacabin-sell-in-uae-2048x1463.webp 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" />															</div>\n				</div>\n				</div>\n		<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1a88749 e-con-full e-flex wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no wpr-column-slider-no wpr-equal-height-no e-con e-child\" data-id=\"1a88749\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-273477e elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"273477e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n									<ol><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Send Us Your Cabin Details.</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Share the size, approximate age, and condition of your unit, along with a few photos. This gives us enough to provide an initial assessment before any site visit is arranged.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Get a Free Valuation.</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Our team reviews the details you&#8217;ve provided, and arranges a site inspection where needed, to assess the unit&#8217;s structural condition, electrical and plumbing state, and overall usability.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Receive a Fair Offer.</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> We provide a clear offer based on that assessment, explaining the reasoning behind the number rather than issuing a flat take-it-or-leave-it figure.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Agree a Collection Date.</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Once you accept the offer, we schedule collection around your site&#8217;s timeline, so removal doesn&#8217;t disrupt an ongoing project.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Get Paid.</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Payment, whether by cash or bank transfer, is completed before the unit is removed from your site.</span></li></ol><p><b>Trading in?</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> If you&#8217;re selling an older unit while buying a new or refurbished one, we can apply the value of your existing cabin as trade-in credit against the new purchase, so you&#8217;re managing one transaction instead of two.</span></p>								</div>\n				</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a5ff05d elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"a5ff05d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data