class=\"elementskit-box-style-content\">\n                        A new portacabin is factory-built to your specification, with full control over layout, insulation, electrical fit-out, and finish. It carries the longest lead time of the three options, since manufacturing has to happen before delivery, but it\'s the right choice when your project needs a specific configuration that an existing unit can\'t match.                    </div>\n                                    </div>\n\n                            </div>\n            </div>\n    </div>				</div>\n				</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-712f497 elementor-align-center elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-button\" data-id=\"712f497\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"elementskit-button.default\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n					<div class=\"ekit-wid-con\" >		<div class=\"ekit-btn-wraper\">\n							<a href=\"tel:+971%2056%20921%203754\" class=\"elementskit-btn  whitespace--normal\" id=\"\">\n					Get Quote				</a>\n					</div>\n        </div>				</div>\n				</div>\n				</div>\n		<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a9d164b e-con-full e-flex wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no wpr-column-slider-no wpr-equal-height-no e-con e-child\" data-id=\"a9d164b\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f931263 ekit-equal-height-disable elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-image-box\" data-id=\"f931263\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"elementskit-image-box.default\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n					<div class=\"ekit-wid-con\" >\n            <div class=\"elementskit-info-image-box ekit-image-box text-center simple-card\" >\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-box-header image-box-img-center\">\n\n                    <