            </div>\n                            </div>\n            </div>\n    </div>				</div>\n				</div>\n				</div>\n				</div>\n					</div>\n				</div>\n		<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fe3b64f e-flex e-con-boxed wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no wpr-column-slider-no wpr-equal-height-no e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"fe3b64f\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n					<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n		<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-26a4ef4 e-con-full e-flex wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no wpr-column-slider-no wpr-equal-height-no e-con e-child\" data-id=\"26a4ef4\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-adef48e elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"adef48e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n					<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">FAQ\'s</h2>				</div>\n				</div>\n				</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2a9db66 elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-accordion\" data-id=\"2a9db66\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"elementskit-accordion.default\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n					<div class=\"ekit-wid-con\" >\n        <div class=\"elementskit-accordion accoedion-primary\" id=\"accordion-6ad2789b0dd4f\">\n\n            \n                <div class=\"elementskit-card active\">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-card-header\" id=\"primaryHeading-0-2a9db66\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\">\n                        <a href=\"#collapse-f566a246ad2789b0dd4f\" class=\"ekit-accordion--toggler elementskit-btn-link collapsed\" role=\"button\" data-ekit-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#Collapse-f566a246ad2789b0dd4f\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"Collapse-f566a246ad2789b0dd4f\">\n                            \n                            <span class=\"ekit-accordion-title\">How much is a used portacabin worth in UAE?</span>\n\n                            \n                                <div class=\"ekit_accordion_icon_group\">\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_normal_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Normal Icon -->\n										<i class=\"icon icon-down-arrow1\"></i>                                    </div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_active_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Active Icon -->\n										<i class=\"icon icon-up-arrow\"></i>                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n\n                            \n                                                    </a>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div id=\"Collapse-f566a246ad2789b0dd4f\" class=\" show collapse\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"primaryHeading-0-2a9db66\" data-parent=\"#accordion-6ad2789b0dd4f\">\n\n                        <div class=\"elementskit-card-body ekit-accordion--content\">\n                            <p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Valuation depends on size, age, structural condition, and whether the unit has any prior refurbishment work. Sharing photos and details with our team gives you an initial estimate before a full site assessment confirms the final offer.</span></p>                        </div>\n\n                    </div>\n\n                </div><!-- .elementskit-card END -->\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-card \">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-card-header\" id=\"primaryHeading-1-2a9db66\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\">\n                        <a href=\"#collapse-5f0aeec6ad2789b0dd4f\" class=\"ekit-accordion--toggler elementskit-btn-link collapsed\" role=\"button\" data-ekit-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#Collapse-5f0aeec6ad2789b0dd4f\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"Collapse-5f0aeec6ad2789b0dd4f\">\n                            \n                            <span class=\"ekit-accordion-title\">What&#039;s the difference between used and refurbished portacabins?</span>\n\n                            \n                                <div class=\"ekit_accordion_icon_group\">\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_normal_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Normal Icon -->\n										<i class=\"icon icon-down-arrow1\"></i>                                    </div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_active_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Active Icon -->\n										<i class=\"icon icon-up-arrow\"></i>                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n\n                            \n                                                    </a>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div id=\"Collapse-5f0aeec6ad2789b0dd4f\" class=\" collapse\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"primaryHeading-1-2a9db66\" data-parent=\"#accordion-6ad2789b0dd4f\">\n\n                        <div class=\"elementskit-card-body ekit-accordion--content\">\n                            <p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">A used portacabin is sold in the condition the previous owner left it, with no restoration work carried out. A refurbished portacabin has been inspected and repaired, covering structural issues, wiring, and interior condition, which typically means a higher price but a condition closer to new.</span></p>                        </div>\n\n                    </div>\n\n                </div><!-- .elementskit-card END -->\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-card \">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-card-header\" id=\"primaryHeading-2-2a9db66\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\">\n                        <a href=\"#collapse-828dca36ad2789b0dd4f\" class=\"ekit-accordion--toggler elementskit-btn-link collapsed\" role=\"button\" data-ekit-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#Collapse-828dca36ad2789b0dd4f\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"Collapse-828dca36ad2789b0dd4f\">\n                            \n                            <span class=\"ekit-accordion-title\">How quickly can I sell my portacabin?</span>\n\n                            \n                                <div class=\"ekit_accordion_icon_group\">\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_normal_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Normal Icon -->\n										<i class=\"icon icon-down-arrow1\"></i>                                    </div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_active_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Active Icon -->\n										<i class=\"icon icon-up-arrow\"></i>                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n\n                            \n                                                    </a>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div id=\"Collapse-828dca36ad2789b0dd4f\" class=\" collapse\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"primaryHeading-2-2a9db66\" data-parent=\"#accordion-6ad2789b0dd4f\">\n\n                        <div class=\"elementskit-card-body ekit-accordion--content\">\n                            <p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Once you share your unit\'s details, we can usually provide an initial valuation quickly, with a site assessment and final offer following shortly after. Collection is then scheduled around your timeline.</span></p>                        </div>\n\n                    </div>\n\n                </div><!-- .elementskit-card END -->\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-card \">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-card-header\" id=\"primaryHeading-3-2a9db66\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\">\n                        <a href=\"#collapse-081c40d6ad2789b0dd4f\" class=\"ekit-accordion--toggler elementskit-btn-link collapsed\" role=\"button\" data-ekit-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#Collapse-081c40d6ad2789b0dd4f\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"Collapse-081c40d6ad2789b0dd4f\">\n                            \n                            <span class=\"ekit-accordion-title\">Do you buy portacabins in any condition?</span>\n\n                            \n                                <div class=\"ekit_accordion_icon_group\">\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_normal_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Normal Icon -->\n										<i class=\"icon icon-down-arrow1\"></i>                                    </div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_active_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Active Icon -->\n										<i class=\"icon icon-up-arrow\"></i>                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n\n                            \n                                                    </a>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div id=\"Collapse-081c40d6ad2789b0dd4f\" class=\" collapse\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"primaryHeading-3-2a9db66\" data-parent=\"#accordion-6ad2789b0dd4f\">\n\n                        <div class=\"elementskit-card-body ekit-accordion--content\">\n                            <p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">We assess units across a range of conditions, though the offer reflects what we find. Units with significant structural damage may receive a lower valuation or, in some cases, may not be suitable for purchase, which we\'ll explain clearly during the assessment.</span></p>                        </div>\n\n                    </div>\n\n                </div><!-- .elementskit-card END -->\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-card \">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-card-header\" id=\"primaryHeading-4-2a9db66\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\">\n                        <a href=\"#collapse-d6f467a6ad2789b0dd4f\" class=\"ekit-accordion--toggler elementskit-btn-link collapsed\" role=\"button\" data-ekit-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#Collapse-d6f467a6ad2789b0dd4f\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"Collapse-d6f467a6ad2789b0dd4f\">\n                            \n                            <span class=\"ekit-accordion-title\">Can I trade in my old cabin toward a new one?</span>\n\n                            \n                                <div class=\"ekit_accordion_icon_group\">\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_normal_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Normal Icon -->\n										<i class=\"icon icon-down-arrow1\"></i>                                    </div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_active_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Active Icon -->\n										<i class=\"icon icon-up-arrow\"></i>                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n\n                            \n                                                    </a>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div id=\"Collapse-d6f467a6ad2789b0dd4f\" class=\" collapse\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"primaryHeading-4-2a9db66\" data-parent=\"#accordion-6ad2789b0dd4f\">\n\n                        <div class=\"elementskit-card-body ekit-accordion--content\">\n                            <p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Yes. If you\'re replacing an existing unit, we can apply its assessed value as credit against a new or refurbished purchase, reducing what you pay out of pocket.</span></p>                        </div>\n\n                    </div>\n\n                </div><!-- .elementskit-card END -->\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-card \">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-card-header\" id=\"primaryHeading-5-2a9db66\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\">\n                        <a href=\"#collapse-f44603d6ad2789b0dd4f\" class=\"ekit-accordion--toggler elementskit-btn-link collapsed\" role=\"button\" data-ekit-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#Collapse-f44603d6ad2789b0dd4f\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"Collapse-f44603d6ad2789b0dd4f\">\n                            \n                            <span class=\"ekit-accordion-title\">How long does delivery take for a new or used portacabin?</span>\n\n                            \n                                <div class=\"ekit_accordion_icon_group\">\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_normal_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Normal Icon -->\n										<i class=\"icon icon-down-arrow1\"></i>                                    </div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_active_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Active Icon -->\n										<i class=\"icon icon-up-arrow\"></i>                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n\n                            \n                                                    </a>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div id=\"Collapse-f44603d6ad2789b0dd4f\" class=\" collapse\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"primaryHeading-5-2a9db66\" data-parent=\"#accordion-6ad2789b0dd4f\">\n\n                        <div class=\"elementskit-card-body ekit-accordion--content\">\n                            <p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Used and refurbished units from existing stock are generally the fastest to deliver, since no manufacturing is required. New, fully customized units take longer, as production has to be completed before dispatch. Our team can confirm a specific timeline once your requirement is defined.</span></p>                        </div>\n\n                    </div>\n\n                </div><!-- .elementskit-card END -->\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-card \">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-card-header\" id=\"primaryHeading-6-2a9db66\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\">\n                        <a href=\"#collapse-4c561786ad2789b0dd4f\" class=\"ekit-accordion--toggler elementskit-btn-link collapsed\" role=\"button\" data-ekit-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#Collapse-4c561786ad2789b0dd4f\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"Collapse-4c561786ad2789b0dd4f\">\n                            \n                            <span class=\"ekit-accordion-title\">Do you offer installation and customization?</span>\n\n                            \n                                <div class=\"ekit_accordion_icon_group\">\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_normal_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Normal Icon -->\n										<i class=\"icon icon-down-arrow1\"></i>                                    </div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_active_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Active Icon -->\n										<i class=\"icon icon-up-arrow\"></i>                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n\n                            \n                                                    </a>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div id=\"Collapse-4c561786ad2789b0dd4f\" class=\" collapse\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"primaryHeading-6-2a9db66\" data-parent=\"#accordion-6ad2789b0dd4f\">\n\n                        <div class=\"elementskit-card-body ekit-accordion--content\">\n                            <p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Yes. Delivery includes professional installation, and units, whether new, used, or refurbished, can be customized with additional plumbing, electrical work, partitions, or finishes to suit your specific requirement.</span></p>                        </div>\n\n                    </div>\n\n                </div><!-- .elementskit-card END -->\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-card \">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-card-header\" id=\"primaryHeading-7-2a9db66\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\">\n                        <a href=\"#collapse-4e7f5cc6ad2789b0dd4f\" class=\"ekit-accordion--toggler elementskit-btn-link collapsed\" role=\"button\" data-ekit-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#Collapse-4e7f5cc6ad2789b0dd4f\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"Collapse-4e7f5cc6ad2789b0dd4f\">\n                            \n                            <span class=\"ekit-accordion-title\">What documents do I need to sell my portacabin?</span>\n\n                            \n                                <div class=\"ekit_accordion_icon_group\">\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_normal_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Normal Icon -->\n										<i class=\"icon icon-down-arrow1\"></i>                                    </div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_active_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Active Icon -->\n										<i class=\"icon icon-up-arrow\"></i>                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n\n                            \n                                                    </a>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div id=\"Collapse-4e7f5cc6ad2789b0dd4f\" class=\" collapse\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"primaryHeading-7-2a9db66\" data-parent=\"#accordion-6ad2789b0dd4f\">\n\n                        <div class=\"elementskit-card-body ekit-accordion--content\">\n                            <p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Having proof of ownership and any maintenance or refurbishment records available speeds up the valuation process, though we can still assess a unit and provide an offer without complete documentation in most cases.</span></p>                        </div>\n\n                    </div>\n\n                </div><!-- .elementskit-card END -->\n\n                                                        <script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How much is a used portacabin worth in UAE?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400\\\">Valuation depends on size, age, structural condition, and whether the unit has any prior refurbishment work. Sharing photos and details with our team gives you an initial estimate before a full site assessment confirms the final offer.</span></p>\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What&#039;s the difference between used and refurbished portacabins?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400\\\">A used portacabin is sold in the condition the previous owner left it, with no restoration work carried out. A refurbished portacabin has been inspected and repaired, covering structural issues, wiring, and interior condition, which typically means a higher price but a condition closer to new.</span></p>\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How quickly can I sell my portacabin?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400\\\">Once you share your unit\'s details, we can usually provide an initial valuation quickly, with a site assessment and final offer following shortly after. Collection is then scheduled around your timeline.</span></p>\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do you buy portacabins in any condition?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400\\\">We assess units across a range of conditions, though the offer reflects what we find. Units with significant structural damage may receive a lower valuation or, in some cases, may not be suitable for purchase, which we\'ll explain clearly during the assessment.</span></p>\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can I trade in my old cabin toward a new one?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400\\\">Yes. If you\'re replacing an existing unit, we can apply its assessed value as credit against a new or refurbished purchase, reducing what you pay out of pocket.</span></p>\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How long does delivery take for a new or used portacabin?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400\\\">Used and refurbished units from existing stock are generally the fastest to deliver, since no manufacturing is required. New, fully customized units take longer, as production has to be completed before dispatch. Our team can confirm a specific timeline once your requirement is defined.</span></p>\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do you offer installation and customization?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400\\\">Yes. Delivery includes professional installation, and units, whether new, used, or refurbished, can be customized with additional plumbing, electrical work, partitions, or finishes to suit your specific requirement.</span></p>\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What documents do I need to sell my portacabin?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400\\\">Having proof of ownership and any maintenance or refurbishment records available speeds up the valuation process, though we can still assess a unit and provide an offer without complete documentation in most cases.</span></p>\"}}]}</script>\n                                </div>\n    </div>				</div>\n				</div>\n					</div>\n				</div>\n		<div class=\"elementor-element elem