 rental chillers energy efficient?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400\\\">Yes, our fleet is maintained to modern efficiency standards across all capacity ranges.</span></p>\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What happens if the chiller breaks down during the rental period?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400\\\">Our 24/7 support team responds immediately and arranges a replacement unit if required.</span></p>\"}}]}</script>\n                                </div>\n    </div>				</div>\n				</div>\n					</div>\n				</div>\n		<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-367eb36 e-flex e-con-boxed wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no wpr-column-slider-no wpr-equal-height-no e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"367eb36\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n					<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n		<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fc283ba e-con-full e-flex wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no wpr-column-slider-no wpr-equal-height-no e-con e-child\" data-id=\"fc283ba\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8083378 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"8083378\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n					<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Don’t Let the Heat Slow Down Your Site.\n<br>\nGet a Rental Chiller On-Site — Fast.</h2>				</div>\n				</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-add413e elementor-align-left elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-button\" data-id=\"add413e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\