ax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no wpr-column-slider-no wpr-equal-height-no e-con e-child\" data-id=\"4fda80f\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9b69652 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"9b69652\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n					<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">What Is a Rental Chiller?</h2>				</div>\n				</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c63d5b2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"c63d5b2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n									<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A rental chiller is a temporary cooling unit that connects into your existing HVAC or process system without permanent installation.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">It&#8217;s how facilities cover a chiller for rent UAE-wide when a permanent unit fails, needs servicing, or when demand temporarily exceeds capacity.</span></p><p><b>How it works:</b></p><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Unit is delivered and connected to your existing pipework or a temporary loop</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Runs alongside or in place of your permanent system</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Removed at the end of the agreed term with zero disruption to your infrastructure</span></li></ul><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Whether you need to rent a chiller UAE-wide for two days or two seasons, the setup is designed to be non-disruptive.</span></p>								</div>\n				</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a