d class=\"border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top\">Construction sites, events, emergency backup</td><td class=\"border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top\">Factories, malls, hospitals, data centres</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>								</div>\n				</div>\n				</div>\n					</div>\n				</div>\n		<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8af7d28 e-flex e-con-boxed wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no wpr-column-slider-no wpr-equal-height-no e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"8af7d28\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n					<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n		<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-660efb1 e-con-full e-flex wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no wpr-column-slider-no wpr-equal-height-no e-con e-child\" data-id=\"660efb1\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a3da94f elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"a3da94f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n					<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Chiller Rental for Events in UAE</h2>				</div>\n				</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ae7ac26 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ae7ac26\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n									<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Dubai&#8217;s event calendar demands guest comfort that can&#8217;t fail — weddings, exhibitions, concerts, corporate events, and Ramadan tents all rely on stable cooling.<br /><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Chiller rental for events UAE-wide protects both guest comfort and sensitive equipment (AV, catering, staging) from heat exposure.<br /><br /></span></p><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Scaled to guest count and venue size</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Deployed and struck within your event timeline</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Backup capacity available for multi-day events</span></li></ul>								</div>\n				</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8fe0fe7 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"8fe0fe7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n									<div class=\"elementor-button-wrapper\">\n					<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm\" href=\"/contact/\">\n						<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n									<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Contact us</span>\n					</span>\n					</a>\n				</div>\n								</div>\n				</div>\n				</div>\n		<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8f7564d e-con-full e-flex wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no wpr-column-slider-no wpr-equal-height-no e-con e-child\" data-id=\"8f7564d\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n				</div>\n					</div>\n				</div>\n		<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-eace1d4 e-flex e-con-boxed wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no wpr-column-slider-no wpr-equal-height-no e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"eace1d4\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n					<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n		<div