 </h3>\n                                                            <div class=\"elementskit-box-style-content\">\n                        Split AC rental provides efficient temporary cooling for offices, server rooms, events, and other spaces. Units can be installed, maintained, and removed as needed.                    </div>\n                                    </div>\n\n                            </div>\n            </div>\n    </div>				</div>\n				</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0b4a7eb elementor-align-center elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-button\" data-id=\"0b4a7eb\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"elementskit-button.default\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n					<div class=\"ekit-wid-con\" >		<div class=\"ekit-btn-wraper\">\n							<a href=\"tel:+971%2056%20921%203754\" class=\"elementskit-btn  whitespace--normal\" id=\"\">\n					Get Quote				</a>\n					</div>\n        </div>				</div>\n				</div>\n				</div>\n				</div>\n				</div>\n					</div>\n				</div>\n		<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8e61501 e-flex e-con-boxed wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no wpr-column-slider-no wpr-equal-height-no e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"8e61501\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n					<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n		<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8279eae e-con-full e-flex wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no wpr-column-slider-no wpr-equal-height-no e-con e-child\" data-id=\"8279eae\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fec99a1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"fec99a1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n					<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">AC Rental Capacities &amp; Coverage Guide</h2>				</div>\n				</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-02c5f69 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"02c5f69\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n									<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Choosing the right tonnage depends on room size, ceiling height, insulation, and heat load from equipment or occupancy. As a general starting point:</span></p>								</div>\n				</div>\n				</div>\n		<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f9b8cac e-con-full e-flex wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no wpr-column-slider-no wpr-equal-height-no e-con e-child\" data-id=\"f9b8cac\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-be20cb3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"be20cb3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n									<table class=\"min-w-full border-collapse text-sm leading-[1.7] whitespace-normal\"><thead class=\"text-left\"><tr><th class=\"text-text-100 border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.6)] py-2 pr-4 align-top font-bold\" scope=\"col\">Capacity</th><th class=\"text-text-100 border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.6)] py-2 pr-4 align-top font-bold\" scope=\"col\">Approx. Coverage Area</th><th class=\"text-text-100 border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.6)] py-2 pr-4 align-top font-bold\" scope=\"col\">Typical Use Case</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=\"border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top\">1 Ton</td><td class=\"border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top\">Up to 300 sq ft</td><td class=\"border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top\">Small office, kiosk, site cabin</td></tr><tr><td class=\"border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top\">2 Ton</td><td class=\"border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top\">Up to 600 sq ft</td><td class=\"border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top\">Server room, small retail, pharmacy</td></tr><tr><td class=\"border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top\">3–4 Ton</td><td class=\"border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top\">Up to 1,200 sq ft</td><td class=\"border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top\">Medium office, restaurant, showroom</td></tr><tr><td class=\"border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top\">5 Ton+ (Floor-Standing)</td><td class=\"border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top\">1,500+ sq ft</td><td class=\"border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top\">Event tents, warehouses, large retail</td></tr></tbody></table>								</div>\n				</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4807b5c elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"4807b5c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n									<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">These figures are a guide, not a fixed rule: factors like sun exposure, equipment heat, and occupancy can shift the right capacity up or down. Rather than guess, our team offers a free consultation to confirm exact sizing before you commit, so your AC hire in Dubai matches the space from day one.</span></p>								</div>\n				</div>\n				</div>\n					</div>\n				</div>\n		<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f40279b e-flex e-con-boxed wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no wpr-column-slider-no wpr-equal-height-no e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"f40279b\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n					<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n		<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-363fbcf e-con-full e-flex wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no wpr-column-slider-no wpr-equal-height-no e-con e-child\" data-id=\"363fbcf\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9c999c3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"9c999c3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n					<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">AC Rental for Events in UAE\n</h2>				</div>\n				</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f059040 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f059040\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n									<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Weddings, exhibitions, Ramadan tents, corporate functions, and outdoor festivals all share one requirement: guests and attendees need to stay comfortable regardless of the UAE heat. Event AC rental UAE clients turn to Rental Power for is built around that priority: fast turnaround for one-off dates, capacity sized to guest numbers and tent size, and delivery scheduled tightly around your event timeline.</span></p><p> </p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We work with event planners and venues to plan cooling in advance, so units are on-site, tested, and running before guests arrive, then collected promptly once the event wraps, with no lingering rental commitment.</span></p>								</div>\n				</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-el