tails\"> <div class=\"ti-name\"> Farrukh Waqar </div> <div class=\"ti-date\">2026.09.02.</div> </div> </div> <span class=\"ti-stars\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"ti-star skip-lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg\" alt=\"Google star 1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" loading=\"lazy\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"ti-star skip-lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg\" alt=\"Google star 2\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" loading=\"lazy\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"ti-star skip-lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg\" alt=\"Google star 3\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" loading=\"lazy\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"ti-star skip-lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg\" alt=\"Google star 4\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" loading=\"lazy\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"ti-star skip-lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg\" alt=\"Google star 5\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" loading=\"lazy\" /><span class=\"ti-verified-review ti-verified-platform\"><span class=\"ti-verified-tooltip\">Trustindex verifies that the original source of the review is Google.</span></span></span> <div class=\"ti-review-text-container ti-review-content\"><!-- R-CONTENT -->I rented a generator from RentalPower.ae, and I’m very impressed with their service. The generator was reliable, well-maintained, and delivered on time. Their team was professional, responsive, and very helpful throughout the process. Excellent service and highly recommended!<!-- R-CONTENT --></div> <span class=\"ti-read-more\" data-container=\".ti-review-content\" data-collapse-text=\"Hide\" data-open-text=\"Read more\"></span> </div> </div>  </div> <div class=\"ti-controls-line\"> <div class=\"dot\"></div> </div> </div>    </div> </div> </pre></div>\n						</div>\n				</div>\n					</div>\n				</div>\n					</div>\n				</div>\n		<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cefe2dc e-flex e-con-boxed wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no wpr-column-slider-no wpr-equal-height-no e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"cefe2dc\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n					<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n		<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1eebcba e-con-full e-flex wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no wpr-column-slider-no wpr-equal-height-no e-con e-child\" data-id=\"1eebcba\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-296d70f elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"296d70f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n					<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">FAQ\'s</h2>				</div>\n				</div>\n				</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-de0b6cc elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-accordion\" data-id=\"de0b6cc\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"elementskit-accordion.default\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n					<div class=\"ekit-wid-con\" >\n        <div class=\"elementskit-accordion accoedion-primary\" id=\"accordion-6ad22b37294ba\">\n\n            \n                <div class=\"elementskit-card active\">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-card-header\" id=\"primaryHeading-0-de0b6cc\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\">\n                        <a href=\"#collapse-f566a246ad22b37294ba\" class=\"ekit-accordion--toggler elementskit-btn-link collapsed\" role=\"button\" data-ekit-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#Collapse-f566a246ad22b37294ba\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"Collapse-f566a246ad22b37294ba\">\n                            \n                            <span class=\"ekit-accordion-title\">What size AC do I need for my space?</span>\n\n                            \n                                <div class=\"ekit_accordion_icon_group\">\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_normal_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Normal Icon -->\n										<i class=\"icon icon-down-arrow1\"></i>                                    </div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_active_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Active Icon -->\n										<i class=\"icon icon-up-arrow\"></i>                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n\n                            \n                                                    </a>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div id=\"Collapse-f566a246ad22b37294ba\" class=\" show collapse\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"primaryHeading-0-de0b6cc\" data-parent=\"#accordion-6ad22b37294ba\">\n\n                        <div class=\"elementskit-card-body ekit-accordion--content\">\n                            <p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">It depends on room size, ceiling height, insulation, and heat sources like equipment or sun exposure. Our capacity guide above offers a starting point, but we recommend a free consultation for an exact recommendation, since undersizing or oversizing both affect performance and cost.</span></p>                        </div>\n\n                    </div>\n\n                </div><!-- .elementskit-card END -->\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-card \">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-card-header\" id=\"primaryHeading-1-de0b6cc\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\">\n                        <a href=\"#collapse-5f0aeec6ad22b37294ba\" class=\"ekit-accordion--toggler elementskit-btn-link collapsed\" role=\"button\" data-ekit-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#Collapse-5f0aeec6ad22b37294ba\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"Collapse-5f0aeec6ad22b37294ba\">\n                            \n                            <span class=\"ekit-accordion-title\">What&#039;s the difference between portable AC and split AC rental?</span>\n\n                            \n                                <div class=\"ekit_accordion_icon_group\">\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_normal_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Normal Icon -->\n										<i class=\"icon icon-down-arrow1\"></i>                                    </div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_active_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Active Icon -->\n										<i class=\"icon icon-up-arrow\"></i>                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n\n                            \n                                                    </a>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div id=\"Collapse-5f0aeec6ad22b37294ba\" class=\" collapse\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"primaryHeading-1-de0b6cc\" data-parent=\"#accordion-6ad22b37294ba\">\n\n                        <div class=\"elementskit-card-body ekit-accordion--content\">\n                            <p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Portable units are self-contained, require no installation, and can be moved easily, ideal for short-term or temporary use. Split systems have separate indoor and outdoor components, offer quieter and more efficient cooling, and suit longer rental periods where a fixed setup makes sense.</span></p>                        </div>\n\n                    </div>\n\n                </div><!-- .elementskit-card END -->\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-card \">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-card-header\" id=\"primaryHeading-2-de0b6cc\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\">\n                        <a href=\"#collapse-828dca36ad22b37294ba\" class=\"ekit-accordion--toggler elementskit-btn-link collapsed\" role=\"button\" data-ekit-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#Collapse-828dca36ad22b37294ba\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"Collapse-828dca36ad22b37294ba\">\n                            \n                            <span class=\"ekit-accordion-title\">Can I rent an AC for a single event or short-term use?</span>\n\n                            \n                                <div class=\"ekit_accordion_icon_group\">\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_normal_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Normal Icon -->\n										<i class=\"icon icon-down-arrow1\"></i>                                    </div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_active_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Active Icon -->\n										<i class=\"icon icon-up-arrow\"></i>                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n\n                            \n                                                    </a>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div id=\"Collapse-828dca36ad22b37294ba\" class=\" collapse\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"primaryHeading-2-de0b6cc\" data-parent=\"#accordion-6ad22b37294ba\">\n\n                        <div class=\"elementskit-card-body ekit-accordion--content\">\n                            <p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Yes. Daily and weekly rental terms are available specifically for events, emergencies, and short project windows, with delivery and collection scheduled around your exact dates.</span></p>                        </div>\n\n                    </div>\n\n                </div><!-- .elementskit-card END -->\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-card \">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-card-header\" id=\"primaryHeading-3-de0b6cc\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\">\n                  