 by hiab/crane truck — needs clear access for offloading</li>\n<li>Clearance around the unit for airflow and exhaust dispersal</li>\n<li>Silent canopy runs at ~76 dB at 7 m — suitable for events, hotels and occupied buildings</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">What&#8217;s Included With Every 100 kVA Rental</h2>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Every unit arrives ready to run:</p>\n<ul dir=\"ltr\">\n<li>Diesel tank</li>\n<li>Distribution board</li>\n<li>Manual or automatic changeover switch</li>\n<li>Cables and cable ramps</li>\n<li>Delivery, installation and on-site testing</li>\n<li>24/7 support for the rental period</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Cable and breaker sizing is handled by our technicians on-site — a 100 kVA set typically pairs with a 160A–200A main breaker, sized to your actual load and cable run.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Contact us for a quote: +971 56 921 3754</strong></p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">Silent vs. Open-Frame 100 kVA</h2>\n<ul dir=\"ltr\">\n<li><strong>Silent / acoustic</strong> — our fully enclosed <a href=\"/products/silent-generator/\">silent generator</a> runs at ~76 dB at 7 m, for events, hospitals, hotels and residential-adjacent sites</li>\n<li><strong>Open-frame</strong> — lower cost, faster to deploy, best for open construction sites and industrial yards</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Both available for immediate hire across the UAE.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">FAQs</h2>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>How many amps is a 100 kVA generator?</strong> 144 amps at 400V, 3-phase, 50 Hz. On single-phase 230V the figure differs — tell us your connection and we&#8217;ll confirm.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>How much fuel does a 100 kVA generator use per hour?</strong> Around 12 litres/hour at 50% load and up to ~22 litres/hour at full load, depending on your load profile.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>What can a 100 kVA generator run?</strong> About 80 kW of load — a mid-size construction site, a small building on backup, or a medium event. Above ~70 kW, size up to 150 kVA.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>How big is a 100 kVA generator?</strong> A silent 100 kVA unit is roughly 2.4 m long, 0.86 m wide and 1.57 m high, weighing about 1,600 kg. It needs firm level ground and crane/hiab access for placement.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>What&#8217;s the minimum rental period for a 100 kVA generator?</strong> We offer short-term and long-term rentals — get in touch with your project dates and we&#8217;ll confirm terms.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">Rent a 100 kVA Generator Today</h2>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Need 80 kW of reliable power on-site fast? We deliver 100 kVA generators across Dubai, Abu Dhabi and Sharjah with same-day dispatch on standard sizes — part of our full <a href=\"/services/generator/rental-generator-in-uae/\">rental generator in UAE</a> fleet.</p>\n<p><a href=\"tel: +971 56 921 3754\"><strong>+971 56 921 3754</strong></a></p>\n','http://localhost:8000/storage/media/1-1.jpg','default','published','100 kVA Generator Rental UAE | 80 kW Diesel Genset Hire','Rent a 100 kVA diesel generator in UAE - 144 amps, ~22 L/hr fuel use, delivered across Dubai, Abu Dhabi & Sharjah. Cummins & Perkins units.',NULL,'https://rentalpower.ae/products/100-kva-generator-rental/','100 kVA Generator Rental UAE | 80 kW Diesel Genset Hire','Rent a 100 kVA diesel generator in UAE - 144 amps, ~22 L/hr fuel use, delivered across Dubai, Abu Dhabi & Sharjah. Cummins & Perkins units.','http://localhost:8000/storage/media/1-1.jpg',1,'100 kva generator rental in uae',94,100,'2026-10-17 04:49:54','2026-10-18 02:18:09',NULL),(146,1,'1000 kVA Generator Rental in UAE','products/1000-kva-generator-rental','<p dir=\"ltr\">A 1000 kVA <a href=\"/products/diesel-generator/\">diesel generator</a> delivers 800 kW of usable power — the scale needed for major infrastructure projects, industrial plants, data centres and utility-grade backup. At this size, sets are usually supplied containerised for transport and low noise, and can be synchronised together for multi-megawatt sites. <a href=\"/\">Rental Power</a> supplies serviced, load-tested 1000 kVA units from Cummins and Perkins across Dubai, Abu Dhabi and Sharjah, with the fuel, transformer and sync setup planned around your project. The confirmed specs are below.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Call now: <a href=\"tel: +971 56 921 3754\">+971 56 921 3754</a></strong></p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">What a 1000 kVA Generator Powers</h2>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">A 1000 kVA set gives you around 800 kW of continuous usable load — genuinely utility-scale power. Typical deployments:</p>\n<ul dir=\"ltr\">\n<li><strong>Major construction / EPC projects</strong> — full site power for large infrastructure builds, sometimes several units in parallel</li>\n<li><strong>Data centres</strong> — prime or backup power for server halls with the headroom to carry cooling load alongside IT</li>\n<li><strong>Power stations &amp; utility backup</strong> — temporary generation during grid works, upgrades or outages</li>\n<li><strong>Large industrial plants &amp; mining</strong> — continuous prime power for heavy process loads</li>\n<li><strong>Isolated / off-grid sites</strong> — a reliable primary power source where there is no usable grid</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Below ~600 kW, a <a href=\"/products/500kva-generator-hire/\">500 kVA generator</a> is the more economical choice. Above 800 kW, we synchronise multiple 1000 kVA units for the exact capacity and redundancy your project needs.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">1000 kVA Generator Specifications</h2>\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"col\">Specification</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Prime output</td>\n<td>1000 kVA / 800 kW</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Standby output</td>\n<td>up to ~1100 kVA</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Voltage</td>\n<td>400V 3-phase / 230V single-phase</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Full-load current</td>\n<td>~1,443 amps at 400V, 3-phase</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Frequency</td>\n<td>50 Hz</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Speed</td>\n<td>1500 rpm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Power factor</td>\n<td>0.8</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Engine options</td>\n<td>Cummins (KTA38 / QST30 class), Perkins</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Enclosure</td>\n<td>20ft containerised (standard) or open-frame</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Synchronisation</td>\n<td>Multiple units can be paralleled for higher capacity / N+1</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">1000 kVA Generator Fuel Consumption</h2>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">At 800 kW, fuel is a major project cost and needs planning around bulk supply. Approximate diesel use for a 1000 kVA set by load:</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"col\">Load</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">Power drawn</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">Fuel use</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>25%</td>\n<td>200 kW</td>\n<td>~53 litres/hour</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>50%</td>\n<td>400 kW</td>\n<td>~98 litres/hour</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>75%</td>\n<td>600 kW</td>\n<td>~144 litres/hour</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>100%</td>\n<td>800 kW</td>\n<td>~182 litres/hour</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">At a typical 50% load, that&#8217;s around 98 litres/hour — roughly 2,350 litres on a 24-hour day. A set this size burns through a standard daily tank fast, so most deployments run on bulk external tanks with a scheduled refuelling plan. We size the fuel setup and manage supply logistics as part of the rental.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">Containerised vs. Open &#8211; and Why It Matters at This Size</h2>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Unlike smaller sets that ship in a canopy, a 1000 kVA unit is typically housed in a <strong>20ft ISO shipping container</strong> that doubles as the acoustic enclosure:</p>\n<ul dir=\"ltr\">\n<li><strong>Containerised</strong> — weatherproof, low noise (~85 dBA at 1 m), and craned/transported as a standard container, which simplifies delivery to large or remote sites. Doors on both ends and sides for maintenance access.</li>\n<li><strong>Open-frame</strong> — for permanent plant rooms or where the site already provides an enclosure.</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">40ft container builds with integral bulk fuel tanks are available for extended prime-power runs.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">Dimensions, Weight &amp; Site Placement</h2>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">A 1000 kVA set is heavy plant and needs proper access planning:</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"col\">Specification</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">20ft Containerised</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">Open-frame</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Length</td>\n<td>~6.1 m (20ft container)</td>\n<td>~5.0 m</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Width</td>\n<td>~2.4 m</td>\n<td>~2.0 m</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Height</td>\n<td>~2.6 m</td>\n<td>~2.3 m</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weight</td>\n<td>~10,000 kg+</td>\n<td>~8,000 kg</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Placement requirements:</strong></p>\n<ul dir=\"ltr\">\n<li>Engineered hardstanding or compacted ground able to take 8–10+ tonnes</li>\n<li>Delivered by low-loader and offloaded by crane / container handler — plan wide, clear access</li>\n<li>Space for exhaust dispersal, radiator airflow and bulk fuel tank siting</li>\n<li>For grid-tie or HV distribution, a step-up transformer (e.g. ~1250 kVA) can be supplied</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">What&#8217;s Included With Every 1000 kVA Rental</h2>\n<ul dir=\"ltr\">\n<li>Base or bulk fuel tank with feed system</li>\n<li>Distribution and output cabinet</li>\n<li>Automatic changeover / ATS (where required)</li>\n<li>Synchronisation panel for multi-unit setups</li>\n<li>Power cabling and cable ramps</li>\n<li>Step-up transformer and load bank (on request)</li>\n<li>Delivery, installation, commissioning and on-site load testing</li>\n<li>24/7 support and managed refuelling for the rental period</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">A 1000 kVA set draws ~1,443 A, so it pairs with a 1600A main breaker and heavy-gauge cabling, sized and installed by our technicians.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Contact us for a quote: <a href=\"tel: +971 56 921 3754\">+971 56 921 3754</a></strong></p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">Align Multiple 1000 kVA Units</h2>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">For sites needing more than 800 kW, or N+1 redundancy on critical load, we parallel multiple 1000 kVA units on a synchronisation panel — sharing load evenly and keeping the site running if one unit is taken offline for service. This is standard for data centres, large events and prime-power installations. For continuous heavy-industrial duty, see our heavy duty generator range.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">FAQs</h2>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>How many amps is a 1000 kVA generator?</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Around 1,443 amps at 400V, 3-phase, 50 Hz. We confirm the exact figure and breaker sizing for your connection.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>How much fuel does a 1000 kVA generator use per hour?</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Around 98 litres/hour at 50% load and up to ~182 litres/hour at full load — roughly 2,350 litres a day at typical load. We plan bulk fuel supply around your runtime.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>What can a 1000 kVA generator run?</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">About 800 kW — a major construction project, a data centre, an industrial plant, or utility-grade backup. For more than 800 kW, we synchronise multiple units.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Is a 1000 kVA generator containerised?</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Usually yes. At this size the standard build is a 20ft ISO container that acts as the acoustic enclosure and makes transport straightforward. Open-frame is available for plant rooms.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Can I run several 1000 kVA generators in parallel?</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Yes — units synchronise on a sync panel to share load or provide N+1 redundancy. We supply and commission the setup.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>What&#8217;s the minimum rental period for a 1000 kVA generator?</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Sets this size are usually project rentals — share your project dates and load profile and we&#8217;ll confirm terms.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">Rent a 1000 kVA Generator Today</h2>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Need 800 kW of project-grade power on-site? We deliver containerised 1000 kVA generators across Dubai, Abu Dhabi and Sharjah, with fuel, transformer and synchronisation handled — part of our full <a href=\"/services/generator/rental-generator-in-uae/\">rental generator in UAE</a> fleet.</p>\n<p><a href=\"tel: +971 56 921 3754\"><strong>+971 56 921 3754</strong></a></p>\n','http://localhost:8000/storage/media/2-1.jpg','default','published','1000 kVA Generator Rental UAE | 800 kW Genset Hire','Rent a 1000 kVA diesel generator in UAE with 800 kW capacity and 1,443 amps. Reliable power with delivery across Dubai, Abu Dhabi & Sharjah.',NULL,'https://rentalpower.ae/products/1000-kva-generator-rental/','1000 kVA Generator Rental UAE | 800 kW Genset Hire','Rent a 1000 kVA diesel generator in UAE with 800 kW capacity and 1,443 amps. Reliable power with delivery across Dubai, Abu Dhabi & Sharjah.','http://localhost:8000/storage/media/2-1.jpg',1,'1000 kva generator rental in uae',91,100,'2026-10-17 04:49:54','2026-10-18 02:18:09',NULL),(147,1,'1000 kVA Generator Rental in UAE','1000-kva-generator-rental','<p dir=\"ltr\">A 1000 kVA <a href=\"/products/diesel-generator/\">diesel generator</a> delivers 800 kW of usable power — the scale needed for major infrastructure projects, industrial plants, data centres and utility-grade backup. At this size, sets are usually supplied containerised for transport and low noise, and can be synchronised together for multi-megawatt sites. <a href=\"/\">Rental Power</a> supplies serviced, load-tested 1000 kVA units from Cummins and Perkins across Dubai, Abu Dhabi and Sharjah, with the fuel, transformer and sync setup planned around your project. The confirmed specs are below.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Call now: <a href=\"tel: +971 56 921 3754\">+971 56 921 3754</a></strong></p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">What a 1000 kVA Generator Powers</h2>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">A 1000 kVA set gives you around