 heavy-industrial duty, see our heavy duty generator range.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">FAQs</h2>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>How many amps is a 1000 kVA generator?</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Around 1,443 amps at 400V, 3-phase, 50 Hz. We confirm the exact figure and breaker sizing for your connection.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>How much fuel does a 1000 kVA generator use per hour?</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Around 98 litres/hour at 50% load and up to ~182 litres/hour at full load — roughly 2,350 litres a day at typical load. We plan bulk fuel supply around your runtime.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>What can a 1000 kVA generator run?</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">About 800 kW — a major construction project, a data centre, an industrial plant, or utility-grade backup. For more than 800 kW, we synchronise multiple units.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Is a 1000 kVA generator containerised?</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Usually yes. At this size the standard build is a 20ft ISO container that acts as the acoustic enclosure and makes transport straightforward. Open-frame is available for plant rooms.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Can I run several 1000 kVA generators in parallel?</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Yes — units synchronise on a sync panel to share load or provide N+1 redundancy. We supply and commission the setup.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>What&#8217;s the minimum rental period for a 1000 kVA generator?</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Sets this size are usually project rentals — share your project dates and load profile and we&#8217;ll confirm terms.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">Rent a 1000 kVA Generator Today</h2>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Need 800 kW of project-grade power on-site? We deliver containerised 1000 kVA generators across Dubai, Abu Dhabi and Sharjah, with fuel, transformer and synchronisation handled — part of our full <a href=\"/services/generator/rental-generator-in-uae/\">rental generator in UAE</a> fleet.</p>\n<p><a href=\"tel: +971 56 921 3754\"><strong>+971 56 921 3754</strong></a></p>\n','http://localhost:8000/storage/media/2-1.jpg','default','published','1000 kVA Generator Rental UAE | 800 kW Genset Hire','Rent a 1000 kVA diesel generator in UAE with 800 kW capacity and 1,443 amps. Reliable power with delivery across Dubai, Abu Dhabi & Sharjah.',NULL,'https://rentalpower.ae/products/1000-kva-generator-rental/','1000 kVA Generator Rental UAE | 800 kW Genset Hire','Rent a 1000 kVA diesel generator in UAE with 800 kW capacity and 1,443 amps. Reliable power with delivery across Dubai, Abu Dhabi & Sharjah.','http://localhost:8000/storage/media/2-1.jpg',1,'1000 kva generator rental in uae',94,100,'2026-10-17 04:49:54','2026-10-18 02:18:09',NULL),(148,1,'500 kVA Generator Rental in UAE','products/500kva-generator-hire','<p dir=\"ltr\">A 500 kVA <a href=\"/products/diesel-generator/\">diesel generator</a> delivers 400 kW of usable power — enough to run a large construction site, an industrial facility, a data centre on backup, or a major event.<a href=\"/\"> Rental Power</a> supplies serviced, load-tested 500 kVA units from Cummins and Perkins across Dubai, Abu Dhabi and Sharjah, delivered and connected on-site. The exact specs are below — fuel consumption, output, footprint — so you can confirm this is the right size before you book.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Call now: <a href=\"tel: +971 56 921 3754\">+971 56 921 3754</a></strong></p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">What a 500 kVA Generator Powers</h2>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">A 500 kVA set gives you around 400 kW of continuous usable load. Realistic uses:</p>\n<ul dir=\"ltr\">\n<li><strong>Large construction site</strong> — multiple tower cranes, concrete plant, welding, site-wide lighting and offices on one supply</li>\n<li><strong>Industrial facility / factory</strong> — process machinery, compressors and production lines</li>\n<li><strong>Data centre or hospital backup</strong> — critical load with the headroom to carry HVAC and IT together</li>\n<li><strong>Major event or concert</strong> — full staging, l