>\n<td>~850–900 litres (approx. 8 hrs at full load)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">500 kVA Generator Fuel Consumption</h2>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Fuel is the biggest cost on a set this size, so plan around it. Approximate diesel use for a 500 kVA generator by load:</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"col\">Load</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">Power drawn</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">Fuel use</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>25%</td>\n<td>100 kW</td>\n<td>~30 litres/hour</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>50%</td>\n<td>200 kW</td>\n<td>~52 litres/hour</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>75%</td>\n<td>300 kW</td>\n<td>~76 litres/hour</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>100%</td>\n<td>400 kW</td>\n<td>~100 litres/hour</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Most sites run near 50% load, so expect roughly 52 litres/hour — around 1,250 litres on a 24-hour day. The standard base tank holds ~850–900 litres for about 8 hours at full load; larger external bulk tanks are available for extended runtime. We quote fuel as a separate line item, so there are no billing surprises.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">Dimensions, Weight &amp; Site Placement</h2>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">A 500 kVA set is heavy plant — plan access and ground before delivery day:</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"col\">Specification</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">Silent (canopied)</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">Open-frame</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Length</td>\n<td>~5.5 m</td>\n<td>~3.4 m</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Width</td>\n<td>~1.2 m</td>\n<td>~1.5 m</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Height</td>\n<td>~2.5 m</td>\n<td>~2.2 m</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weight</td>\n<td>~4,900 kg</td>\n<td>~3,900 kg</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Placement requirements:</strong></p>\n<ul dir=\"ltr\">\n<li>Firm, compacted ground or hardstanding able to take ~5 tonnes</li>\n<li>Delivered by crane/hiab or low-loader — needs clear, wide access for offloading</li>\n<li>Room around the unit for airflow, exhaust dispersal and refuelling access</li>\n<li>Silent canopy for noise-sensitive sites like events, hospitals and occupied buildings</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">What&#8217;s Included With Every 500 kVA Rental</h2>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Every unit arrives ready to run:</p>\n<ul dir=\"ltr\">\n<li>Base fuel tank</li>\n<li>Distribution board</li>\n<li>Manual or automatic changeover switch</li>\n<li>Synchronisation panel (for multi-unit setups)</li>\n<li>Cables and cable ramps</li>\n<li>Delivery, installation and on-site load testing</li>\n<li>24/7 support for the rental period</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Cable and breaker sizing is handled by our technicians on-site — a 500 kVA set draws 722 A, so it pairs with an 800A main breaker and appropriately rated cabling, sized to your load and run.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Contact us for a quote: <a href=\"tel:+971 56 921 3754\">+971 56 921 3754</a></strong></p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">Silent vs. Open-Frame 500 kVA</h2>\n<ul dir=\"ltr\">\n<li><strong>Silent / acoustic</strong> — our fully enclosed <a href=\"/products/silent-generator/\">silent generator</a> is built for noise-sensitive sites like events, hospitals, hotels and occupied buildings</li>\n<li><strong>Open-frame</strong> — lower cost, faster to deploy, best for open industrial sites, oilfields and yards</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Both available for immediate hire across the UAE. For continuous high-load industrial duty, see our heavy duty generator range.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">FAQs</h2>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>How many amps is a 500 kVA generator?</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">722 amps at 400V, 3-phase, 50 Hz. Tell us your connection and we&#8217;ll confirm for your setup.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>How much fuel does a 500 kVA generator use per hour?</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Around 52 litres/hour at 50% load and up to ~100 litres/hour at full load, depending on your load profile.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>What can a 500 kVA generator run?</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">About 400 kW of load — a large construction site, an industrial facility, a data centre or hospital on backup, or a major event. Above ~350 kW, step up to 1000 kVA or synchronise multiple units.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>How big is a 500 kVA generator?</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">A silent 500 kVA unit is roughly 5.5 m long, 1.2 m wide and 2.5 m high, weighing about 4,900 kg. It needs compacted ground and crane or low-loader access for placement.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Can I run two 500 kVA generators together?</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Yes — units can be synchronised to share load or provide N+1 redundancy for critical sites. We supply the sync panels and set it up on-site.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>What&#8217;s the minimum rental period for a 500 kVA generator?</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">We offer short-term and long-term rentals — get in touch with your project dates and we&#8217;ll confirm terms.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">Rent a 500 kVA Generator Today</h2>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Need 400 kW of reliable power on-site fast? We deliver 500 kVA generators across Dubai, Abu Dhabi and Sharjah — part of our full <a href=\"/services/generator/rental-generator-in-uae/\">rental generator in UAE</a> fleet.</p>\n<p><a href=\"tel:+971 56 921 3754\"><strong>+971 56 921 3754</strong></a></p>\n','http://localhost:8000/storage/media/5-1.jpg','default','published','500 kVA Generator Rental UAE | 400 kW Diesel Genset Hire','Rent a 500 kVA diesel generator in UAE - 722 amps, ~100 L/hr fuel use, delivered across Dubai, Abu Dhabi & Sharjah. Cummins & Perkins units.',NULL,'https://rentalpower.ae/products/500kva-generator-hire/','500 kVA Generator Rental UAE | 400 kW Diesel Genset Hire','Rent a 500 kVA diesel generator in UAE - 722 amps, ~100 L/hr fuel use, delivered across Dubai, Abu Dhabi & Sharjah. Cummins & Perkins units.','http://localhost:8000/storage/media/5-1.jpg',1,'500 kva generator rental in uae',91,100,'2026-10-17 04:49:54','2026-10-18 02:18:09',NULL),(150