 your conservation routine</h4>\n<p>1. Yearly conservation Tasks</p>\n<ul>\n<li>check and clean the air pollutants or water pollutants( for water- cooled systems).</li>\n<li>Check refrigerant situations and look for any leaks.</li>\n<li>check the condenser coils for dust buildup.</li>\n<li>insure tailwind is unstopped.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>2. Daily conservation Tasks</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Clean the evaporator coils and check for any signs of wear and tear.</li>\n<li>Test temperature and pressure controls to insure they&#8217;re performing rightly.</li>\n<li>Check the sequestration on refrigerant lines and insure there are no leaks.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>3. Periodic conservation Tasks</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Perform a complete system examination.</li>\n<li>Replace worn corridor, including seals, hoses, and faucets.</li>\n<li>corroborate the cooling capacity and insure the chiller meets performance norms.</li>\n<li>chiller conservation roster</li>\n<li>preventative chiller conservation</li>\n<li>Temporary AC unit rental</li>\n</ul>\n<h5>Why Rent Your Cooling Systems from Rental Cooling?</h5>\n<p>Choosing Rental Cooling for your chiller conservation and Rental needs offers numerous advantages, including</p>\n<p>Wide Range of Rental Options From movable HVAC Rental units to artificial chiller settlements for construction, we offer a broad selection of rental cooling systems.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Expert conservation Services Our platoon of experts provides thorough chiller conservation to insure your outfit works efficiently and reliably.</li>\n<li>Flexible Rental Terms We offer short- term and long- term rental options, allowing you to conform your service to meet your requirements.</li>\n<li>Cost-Effective results Our services are competitively priced, offering you the stylish value for your investment in cooling outfit and conservation.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Ready to keep your cooling systems running easily? Contact Rental Cooling moment for professional chiller conservation services in the UAE. Whether you need temporary chiller Rental , artificial chiller conservation, or dependable chiller form, we&#8217;re your go- to experts for all your cooling needs.</p>\n<p>Call us now or fill out our online form to get a free quotation for your chiller conservation or rental cooling system. Let us help you optimize your cooling systems and avoid expensive breakdowns.</p>\n<p><a href=\"/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-1572\" src=\"/storage/media/2024/11/rentalpower-1-300x45.png\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" srcset=\"/storage/media/2024/11/rentalpower-1-300x45.png 300w, /storage/media/2024/11/rentalpower-1-177x27.png 177w, /storage/media/2024/11/rentalpower-1.png 600w\" alt=\"rental power in uae\" width=\"300\" height=\"45\" /></a></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"tel:+971569213754\">Tel: +971 56 921 3754</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"mailto:sales@rentalpower.ae\">sales@rentalpower.ae</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/\">www.rentalpower.ae</a></li>\n</ul>\n','http://localhost:8000/storage/media/service4.jpg','default','published','chiller maintenance - Rental Power and Rental Cooling in UAE','From weddings to warehouses, our rental cooling chiller maintenance ensure your space stays cool and comfortable.+971 56 921 3754',NULL,'https://rentalpower.ae/chiller-maintenance/','chiller maintenance - Rental Power and Rental Cooling in UAE','From weddings to warehouses, our rental cooling chiller maintenance ensure your space stays cool and comfortable.+971 56 921 3754','http://localhost:8000/storage/media/service4.jpg',1,'chiller maintenance uae',94,100,'2026-10-17 04:49:54','2026-10-18 02:18:09',NULL),(151,1,'Refrigeration Unit Rental in UAE','products/refrigeration-unit-rental-uae','<p dir=\"ltr\">A rental refrigeration unit gives you controlled cold storage on site, without building anything. Most commonly that&#8217;s a refrigerated container — an insulated unit with an integral refrigeration machine that plugs into site power and holds a set temperature anywhere from deep freeze to chilled. For UAE operations handling food, pharmaceuticals or any temperature-sensitive stock, it&#8217;s the fastest way to add cold storage capacity or cover a failed cold room.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">What Makes This Equipment Different?</h2>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">A chiller cools a fluid loop. A refrigeration unit cools and holds a <em>space</em> — and holds it precisely, for as long as the stock is there.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">The equipment is built around that. Insulation runs through walls, floor and ceiling, temperature is controlled to a set point rather than approximately, and the units are designed to run continuously without intervention. Standard refrigerated containers hold a range of about -25°C to +25°C, covering frozen, chilled and controlled-ambient storage from the same unit.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">The second difference is that it&#8217;s self-contained storage. Delivered on a truck, positioned, plugged into a three-phase supply, and it&#8217;s holding temperature within hours. No construction, no permanent installation, no commissioning crew. Refrigeration units on this kind of equipment are typically built by Carrier, Thermo King or Daikin.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">Key Specifications</h2>\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"col\">Specification</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Temperature range</td>\n<td>-25°C to +25°C on standard refrigerated containers</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sizes available</td>\n<td>10ft, 20ft and 40ft</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Internal capacity (20ft)</td>\n<td>Around 11 pallet positions</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Internal capacity (40ft)</td>\n<td>Around 23 pallet positions</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Power supply</td>\n<td>380–460V, 3-phase, 50/60Hz</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Refrigeration machine</td>\n<td>Carrier, Thermo King or Daikin</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Insulation</td>\n<td>Insulated on all sides including floor and ceiling</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Control</td>\n<td>Digital set-point control with temperature display</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Options</td>\n<td>Ramps, strip curtains, internal lighting, panic-release door, remote temperature monitoring</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><em>Exact specifications vary by unit and are confirmed at the time of enquiry.</em></p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">Available Capacities / Options</h2>\n<ul dir=\"ltr\">\n<li><strong>10ft units</strong> — small additional capacity, tight yards, single-product storage</li>\n<li><strong>20ft units</strong> — around 11 pallets; restaurants, supermarkets, mid-size operations</li>\n<li><strong>40ft units</strong> — around 23 pallets; distribution, large-scale food handling, bulk storage</li>\n<li><strong>Frozen or chilled</strong> — the same unit covers both; set the temperature to suit the stock</li>\n<li><strong>Multiple units</strong> — separate units per temperature band, so frozen and chilled stock stay properly separated</li>\n<li><strong>Cold rooms</strong> — modular walk-in rooms, where a container doesn&#8217;t fit the space available</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">Key Features</h2>\n<ul dir=\"ltr\">\n<li>Wide temperature band from deep freeze to controlled ambient in one unit</li>\n<li>Delivered, positioned and running the same day</li>\n<li>Insulated on all sides for stable temperature in UAE heat</li>\n<li>Digital set-point control with temperature display</li>\n<li>Options including ramps, strip curtains and internal lighting</li>\n<li>Remote temperature monitoring available</li>\n<li>Low-humidity storage that protects stock from condensation and mould</li>\n<li>Delivery within 24–48 hours, no minimum hire period, and 24/7 breakdown support</li>\n<li>Serviced and temperature-tested before every hire</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">Applications</h2>\n<ul dir=\"ltr\">\n<li><strong>Cold room breakdown cover</strong> — keeping stock safe while permanent refrigeration is repaired</li>\n<li><strong>Seasonal and peak capacity</strong> — extra storage for Ramadan, event seasons or peak trading</li>\n<li><strong>Food service and retail</strong> — restaurants, hotels, catering operations and supermarkets</li>\n<li><strong>Pharmaceutical and medical storage</strong> — temperature-controlled holding for sensitive goods</li>\n<li><strong>Events and hospitality</strong> — on-site chilled and frozen storage for catering operations</li>\n<li><strong>Construction and remote sites</strong> — cold storage where no permanent facility exists</li>\n<li><strong>Logistics and distribution</strong> — buffer storage during transit or warehouse work</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">Rental Availability in UAE</h2>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Rental Power supplies refrigeration units and cold storage for short-term and long-term hire across Dubai, Abu Dhabi, Sharjah and the wider UAE, delivered ready to plug in and run. Where a project needs chilled water for building or process cooling rather than cold storage, our <a href=\"/services/cooling/rental-chiller-in-uae/\">chiller rental in UAE</a> range covers that side, and units can be supplied with a <a href=\"/services/generator/rental-generator-in-uae/\">rental generator</a> where site power isn&#8217;t available.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">Choosing the Right Option</h2>\n<ul dir=\"ltr\">\n<li><strong>Work out pallet positions, not floor area</strong> — cold storage is planned by how much stock you need to hold.</li>\n<li><strong>Separate your temperature bands</strong> — frozen and chilled stock in one unit means compromising on both. Two units is usually the right answer.</li>\n<li><strong>Check your power supply</strong> — these units need three-phase power and run continuously. Check capacity before delivery day.</li>\n<li><strong>Check access and ground</strong> — a 40ft unit needs truck access and firm, level ground to sit on.</li>\n<li><strong>Plan for door traffic</strong> — frequently opened doors lose temperature; strip curtains help significantly.</li>\n<li><strong>Ask about monitoring</strong> — for pharmaceutical or high-value stock, remote temperature monitoring and alarms are worth specifying.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">FAQs</h2>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>What temperature range can these units hold?</strong> Standard refrigerated containers typically run from about -25°C to +25°C, covering frozen, chilled and controlled-ambient storage.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>What power supply do they need?</strong> Three-phase power, typically in the 380–460V range. We&#8217;ll confirm the exact requirement for the unit you hire, and can supply a generator if site power isn&#8217;t available.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>How much can a unit hold?</strong> Roughly 11 pallets in a 20ft unit and 23 in a 40ft unit, depending on stack height and configuration.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>How quickly can one be delivered?</strong> Typically within 24 to 48 hours of the hire being agreed. Once on site, a unit is running and pulling down to temperature within hours of being connected.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Can I hire one for just a few days?</strong> Yes. There&#8217;s no fixed minimum hire period, so we&#8217;ll quote for the days you actually need — whether that&#8217;s a weekend event or a year of extra storage.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>What if it fails with my stock inside?</strong> Call us, day or night. Breakdown support runs 24/7 for the length of the hire, which is the whole point of hiring cold storage from a rental company rather than buying a unit outright. Call the moment a temperature reading looks wrong rather than waiting to see if it settles — the earlier we know, the more of your stock we can save.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">CTA</h2>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Need cold storage in the UAE?</strong> Tell us the temperature you need, how much stock you&#8217;re holding and for how long, and we&#8217;ll get the right unit to your site within 24 to 48 hours, backed by 24/7 support. <strong>Call <a href=\"tel: +971 56 921 3754\">+971 56 921 3754</a></strong> or request a quote.</p>\n','/storage/media/tempraray-ac-in-uae.jpg','default','published','Refrigeration Unit Rental in UAE - Rental Power and Rental Cooling in UAE','Rent portable air Refrigeration unit rental UAE and stay cool this season. We offer efficient systems for any setting.+971 56 921 3754',NULL,'https://rentalpower.ae/products/refrigeration-unit-rental-uae/','Refrigeration Unit Rental in UAE - Rental Power and Rental Cooling in UAE','Rent portable air Refrigeration unit rental UAE and stay cool this season. We offer efficient systems for any setting.+971 56 921 3754','/storage/media/tempraray-ac-in-uae.jpg',1,'refrigeration unit rental in uae',91,100,'2026-10-17 04:49:54','2026-10-18 02:18:09',NULL),(152,1,'Refrigeration Unit Rental in UAE','refrigeration-unit-rental-uae','<p dir=\"ltr\">A rental refrigeration unit gives you controlled cold storage on site, without building anything. Most commonly that&#8217;s a refrigerated container — an insulated unit with an integral refrigeration machine that plugs into site power and holds a set temperature anywhere from deep freeze to chilled. For UAE operations handling food, pharmaceuticals or any temperature-sensitive stock, it&#8217;s the fastest way to add cold storage capacity or cover a failed cold room.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">What Makes This Equipment Different?</h2>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">A chiller cools a fluid loop. A refrigeration unit cools and holds a <em>space</em> — and holds it precisely, for as long as the stock is there.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">The equipment is built around that. Insulation runs through walls, floor and ceiling, temperature is controlled to a set point rather than approximately, and the units are designed to run continuously without intervention. Standard refrigerated containers hold a range of about -25°C to +25°C, covering frozen, chilled and controlled-ambient storage from the same unit.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">The second difference i