 TR</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Leaving fluid temperature</td>\n<td>Below 0°C on glycol-capable units</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fluid</td>\n<td>Water or water-glycol mix</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Compressor type</td>\n<td>Scroll</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Refrigerant</td>\n<td>Varies by unit; confirmed at enquiry</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Power supply</td>\n<td>Smaller units single-phase; larger units 400V / 3-phase</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pump and tank</td>\n<td>Integral pump and reservoir on board</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mobility</td>\n<td>Locking castors on smaller units; skid or trailer mount on larger</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Condenser</td>\n<td>Air-cooled; no tower or water supply needed</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Control</td>\n<td>Digital thermostat with set-point control</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><em>Exact specifications vary by unit and are confirmed at the time of enquiry based on your load and site conditions.</em></p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">Available Capacities / Options</h2>\n<ul dir=\"ltr\">\n<li><strong>Spot coolers (around 1–5 TR)</strong> — server rooms, control rooms, single workstations, small retail units</li>\n<li><strong>Small process chillers (around 5–15 TR)</strong> — laser cutters, injection moulding, laboratory and medical equipment, food production lines</li>\n<li><strong>Mid portable chillers (around 20–40 TR)</strong> — small venues, temporary offices, multi-machine process loads</li>\n<li><strong>Glycol-spec units</strong> — for below-zero leaving temperatures on process duty</li>\n<li><strong>Multiple units</strong> — several portables spread across a site instead of one central machine, so each area is controlled independently</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">Key Features</h2>\n<ul dir=\"ltr\">\n<li>Moves on locking castors or lifts on a skid — no crane for smaller units</li>\n<li>Integral pump and reservoir, so nothing extra to size or install</li>\n<li>Runs on site power; smaller units on a standard supply</li>\n<li>Air-cooled — no cooling tower, no water connection</li>\n<li>Glycol-capable units available for below-zero process duty</li>\n<li>Set-point control with stable temperature holding</li>\n<li>Redeployable — move it to the next area when the job changes</li>\n<li>Delivery within 24–48 hours, no minimum hire period, and 24/7 breakdown support</li>\n<li>Serviced and tested before every hire</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">Applications</h2>\n<ul dir=\"ltr\">\n<li><strong>Process cooling</strong> — holding machinery, moulds or production fluid at temperature</li>\n<li><strong>Server and control rooms</strong> — emergency cooling when building HVAC fails</li>\n<li><strong>Food and beverage production</strong> — temperature-critical stages on smaller lines</li>\n<li><strong>Laboratories and medical equipment</strong> — steady cooling for heat-generating instruments</li>\n<li><strong>Small events and temporary offices</strong> — chilled water for a single AHU or fan coil</li>\n<li><strong>Maintenance cover</strong> — keeping one area cool while permanent plant is serviced</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">Rental Availability in UAE</h2>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Rental Power supplies portable and mobile chillers for short-term and long-term hire across Dubai, Abu Dhabi, Sharjah and the wider UAE, delivered ready to connect. For loads beyond what a portable unit carries, this equipment sits within our wider <a href=\"/services/cooling/rental-chiller-in-uae/\">chiller rental in UAE</a> range, so we can move you up to a larger skid-mounted machine whenever the job needs it.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">Choosing the Right Option</h2>\n<ul dir=\"ltr\">\n<li><strong>Work out the heat load, not the room size</strong> — process cooling is sized on the heat your equipment produces.</li>\n<li><strong>Check the fluid temperature you need</strong> — below 0°C means a glycol-spec unit.</li>\n<li><strong>Check the power you have</strong> — small units may run single-phase, but larger ones need three-phase.</li>\n<li><strong>Think about where the heat goes</strong> — an air-cooled portable rejects heat into the space around it, so indoor use needs ducting or ventilation.</li>\n<li><strong>Consider several small units instead of one large one</strong> — independent control per area, and no single point of failure.</li>\n<li><strong>If the load is above roughly 40 TR</strong> — an <a href=\"/products/air-cooled-chiller-rental-uae/\">air-cooled chiller</a> is the better fit.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">FAQs</h2>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>What&#8217;s the difference between a portable chiller and a spot cooler?</strong> A spot cooler blows cold air directly into a space. A portable chiller cools a fluid loop that then feeds equipment or an air handler. Different jobs.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Can it run below zero?</strong> With a glycol mix and a unit specified for it, yes. Confirm the leaving temperature you need when enquiring.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Does it need a water supply?</strong> No. The loop is closed and the condenser is air-cooled. You fill the reservoir at start-up and top up as needed.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Can I use it indoors?</strong> Yes, but the heat it removes has to go somewhere. Indoor placement usually needs ducted condenser discharge or adequate ventilation.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>How mobile is it really?</strong> Smaller units roll on locking castors and move by hand. Larger portables are skid-mounted and need a forklift or tail-lift.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\"></h2>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Need a portable chiller in the UAE?</strong> Tell us the heat load, fluid temperature and power available on site, and we&#8217;ll match the right unit — delivered within 24 to 48 hours, for as long or short a period as you need. <strong>Call <a href=\"tel:+971 56 921 3754\">+971 56 921 3754</a></strong> or request a quote.</p>\n','/storage/media/pot.jpg','default','published','Portable Chiller Rental in UAE - Rental Power and Rental Cooling in UAE','Stay comfortable at your event with our high-performance Portable chiller rental cooling solutions. No installation required.+971 56 921 3754',NULL,'https://rentalpower.ae/products/portable-chiller-rental-uae/','Portable Chiller Rental in UAE - Rental Power and Rental Cooling in UAE','Stay comfortable at your event with our high-performance Portable chiller rental cooling solutions. No installation required.+971 56 921 3754','/storage/media/pot.jpg',1,'portable chiller rental in uae',91,100,'2026-10-17 04:49:54','2026-10-18 02:18:09',NULL),(155,1,'Water Cooled Chiller Rental in UAE','products/water-cooled-chiller-rental-uae','<p dir=\"ltr\">A water-cooled chiller rejects heat into a condenser water loop rather than into the air, with a cooling tower doing the final heat rejection. That extra step makes it significantly more efficient than an air-cooled machine and lets it deliver much higher capacity from a smaller footprint. It&#8217;s the right choice when the load is large, the hire is long, and the site can supply condenser water and space for a tower.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">What Makes This Equipment Different?</h2>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Efficiency and capacity per square metre.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">A water-cooled chiller condenses against water temperature rather than outside air temperature, and water temperature tracks the wet-bulb, which is lower than the dry-bulb. That&#8217;s why water-cooled machines run at roughly 0.55 to 0.85 kW per ton against roughly 1.2 to 1.5 kW per ton for air-cooled plants. Over a long hire at high load, that difference shows up directly on the electricity bill.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Capacity is the other difference. Packaged air-cooled chillers are typically manufactured up to around 500 TR, while packaged water-cooled chillers are manufactured up to around 4,000 TR. Large duties can be met with fewer machines and less space.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">The cost is complexity. A water-cooled installation needs a cooling tower, condenser water pumps, make-up water and water treatment to control scale and biological growth. That&#8217;s more equipment, more space and a longer install. It&#8217;s the right answer for large, long jobs and the wrong one for a fast temporary fix.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">Key Specifications</h2>\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"col\">Specification</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Capacity range</td>\n<td>From around 300 TR upward on the UAE rental market</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Typical efficiency</td>\n<td>Roughly 0.55–0.85 kW/TR at plant level</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Compressor type</td>\n<td>Screw or centrifugal</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Refrigerant</td>\n<td>Varies by unit; confirmed at enquiry</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Power supply</td>\n<td>400V / 3-phase / 50Hz, standard for the UAE</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Condenser</td>\n<td>Water-cooled; requires cooling tower and condenser water circuit</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Heat rejection</td>\n<td>Cooling tower; can be quoted with the chiller or connected to an existing tower</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Water treatment</td>\n<td>Required on open tower circuits</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mounting</td>\n<td>Skid or containerised</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><em>Exact specifications vary by unit and are confirmed at the time of enquiry based on your load and site conditions.</em></p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">Available Capacities / Options</h2>\n<ul dir=\"ltr\">\n<li><strong>Mid (around 300–500 TR)</strong> — large commercial buildings, sustained process cooling</li>\n<li><strong>Large (around 600–1,000 TR)</strong> — industrial plant, district cooling support, major facilities</li>\n<li><strong>Above 1,000 TR</strong> — multiple units manifolded, usually with redundancy built into the design</li>\n<li><strong>With or without tower</strong> — the complete package including cooling tower and condenser pumps, or the chiller alone where you already have heat rejection on site</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">Key Features</h2>\n<ul dir=\"ltr\">\n<li>Markedly lower running cost per ton than an air-cooled equivalent</li>\n<li>Higher capacity from a smaller footprint</li>\n<li>Suited to continuous, high-load operation over long hire periods</li>\n<li>Delivery within 24–48 hours, with 24/7 breakdown support for the length of the hire</li>\n<li>Stable performance largely independent of outside air temperature</li>\n<li>Can connect to existing site condenser water and tower infrastructure</li>\n<li>Supplied with pumps, hoses and manifolds as required</li>\n<li>Serviced and performance-tested before every hire</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">Applications</h2>\n<ul dir=\"ltr\">\n<li><strong>Permanent chiller replacement</strong> — covering a failed or stripped-out plant in a large building</li>\n<li><strong>District cooling support</strong> — supplementary capacity during peak demand or plant maintenance</li>\n<li><strong>Industrial process cooling</strong> — continuous duty in manufacturing, petrochemical and heavy industry</li>\n<li><strong>Data centres</strong> — high, steady loads where efficiency compounds over time</li>\n<li><strong>Long-term projects</strong> — multi-month hires where running cost outweighs installation effort</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">Rental Availability in UAE</h2>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Rental Power supplies water-cooled chillers for hire across Dubai, Abu Dhabi, Sharjah and the wider UAE, including the pumps and connections required to integrate with your condenser water system. This equipment is part of our full <a href=\"/services/cooling/rental-chiller-in-uae/\">chiller rental in UAE</a> fleet, so if a water-cooled configuration isn&#8217;t practical on your site, we can propose an air-cooled alternative instead.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">Choosing the Right Option</h2>\n<ul dir=\"ltr\">\n<li><strong>Check water availability first</strong> — an open cooling tower evaporates water continuously and needs a reliable make-up supply. No water supply means no water-cooled chiller.</li>\n<li><strong>Check space for the tower</strong> — the tower needs its own footprint with clear airflow, and it can&#8217;t sit against a wall.</li>\n<li><strong>Weigh hire duration against install time</strong> — below roughly a month at moderate load, an <a href=\"/products/air-cooled-chiller-rental-uae/\">air-cooled chiller</a> usually wins on total cost and disruption.</li>\n<li><strong>Plan for water treatment</strong> — scale and biological control are part of running an open tower, not optional extras.</li>\n<li><strong>Check the load profile</strong> — the efficiency advantage is largest at sustained high load, and shrinks on intermittent duty.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">FAQs</h2>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>When is water-cooled the better choice?</strong> Large loads, long hires and sustained high running hours, where a site can supply condenser water and tower space.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Is a cooling tower included?</strong> It can be. A water-cooled hire is quoted either as a complete package with tower, condenser pumps and water treatment, or as the chiller alone if your site already has heat rejection. Tell us which you need and we&#8217;ll quote accordingly.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>How much more efficient is it?</strong> At plant level, typically around 0.55–0.85 kW/TR against 1.2–1.5 kW/TR for air-cooled. Actual figures depend on unit, load and conditions.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>How long does installation take?</strong> Equipment is typically delivered within 24 to 48 hours, but installation takes longer than air-cooled: the chiller, tower, pumps and water circuit all need setting up and commissioning, so plan for days rather than hours on site. We&#8217;ll give you a firm schedule once we&#8217;ve seen the site and the load.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Can it connect to our existing cooling tower?</strong> Often yes, if the tower has spare capacity and the water quality is suitable. Our team will check before quoting.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\"></h2>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Planning a large or long-term cooling job?</strong> Send us your load, hire period and what condenser water infrastructure you have on site, and we&#8217;ll tell you whether water-cooled is the right call — with delivery within 24 to 48 hours once it&#8217;s agreed. <strong>Call +971 56 921 3754</strong> or request a quote.</p>\n','http://localhost:8000/storage/media/uae-water-cooled.jpg','default','published','Water Cooled Chiller Rental in UAE - Rental Power and Rental Cooling in UAE','Stay cool with our cost-effective rental cooling services. Ideal for everything from events to workspaces. Water cooled chiller rental UAE',NULL,'https://rentalpower.ae/products/water-cooled-chiller-rental-uae/','Water Cooled Chiller Rental in UAE - Rental Power and Rental Cooling in UAE','Stay cool with our cost-effective rental cooling services. Ideal for everything from events to workspaces. Water cooled chiller rental UAE','http://localhost:8000/storage/media/uae-water-cooled.jpg',1,'water cooled chiller rental in uae',91,100,'2026-10-17 04:49:54','2026-10-18 02:18:09',NULL),(156,1,'Water Cooled Chiller Rental in UAE','water-cooled-chiller-rental-uae','<p dir=\"ltr\">A water-cooled chiller rejects heat into a condenser water loop rather than into the air, with a cooling tower doing the final heat rejection. That extra step makes it significantly more efficient than an air-cooled machine and lets it deliver much higher capacity from a smaller footprint. It&#8217;s the right choice when the load is large, the hire is long, and the site can supply condenser water and space for a tower.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">What Makes This Equipment Different?</h2>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Efficiency and capacity per square metre.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">A water-cooled chiller condenses against water temperature rather than outside air temperature, and water temperature tracks the wet-bulb, which is lower than the dry-bulb. That&#8217;s why water-cooled machines run a