er UAE, including the pumps and connections required to integrate with your condenser water system. This equipment is part of our full <a href=\"/services/cooling/rental-chiller-in-uae/\">chiller rental in UAE</a> fleet, so if a water-cooled configuration isn&#8217;t practical on your site, we can propose an air-cooled alternative instead.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">Choosing the Right Option</h2>\n<ul dir=\"ltr\">\n<li><strong>Check water availability first</strong> — an open cooling tower evaporates water continuously and needs a reliable make-up supply. No water supply means no water-cooled chiller.</li>\n<li><strong>Check space for the tower</strong> — the tower needs its own footprint with clear airflow, and it can&#8217;t sit against a wall.</li>\n<li><strong>Weigh hire duration against install time</strong> — below roughly a month at moderate load, an <a href=\"/products/air-cooled-chiller-rental-uae/\">air-cooled chiller</a> usually wins on total cost and disruption.</li>\n<li><strong>Plan for water treatment</strong> — scale and biological control are part of running an open tower, not optional extras.</li>\n<li><strong>Check the load profile</strong> — the efficiency advantage is largest at sustained high load, and shrinks on intermittent duty.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">FAQs</h2>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>When is water-cooled the better choice?</strong> Large loads, long hires and sustained high running hours, where a site can supply condenser water and tower space.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Is a cooling tower included?</strong> It can be. A water-cooled hire is quoted either as a complete package with tower, condenser pumps and water treatment, or as the chiller alone if your site already has heat rejection. Tell us which you need and we&#8217;ll quote accordingly.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>How much more efficient is it?</strong> At plant level, typically around 0.55–0.85 kW/TR against 1.2–1.5 kW/TR for air-cooled. Actual figures depend on unit, load and conditions.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>How long does installation take?</strong> Equipment is typically delivered within 24 to 48 hours, but installation takes longer than air-cooled: the chiller, tower, pumps and water circuit all need setting up and commissioning, so plan for days rather than hours on site. We&#8217;ll give you a firm schedule once we&#8217;ve seen the site and the load.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Can it connect to our existing cooling tower?</strong> Often yes, if the tower has spare capacity and the water quality is suitable. Our team will check before quoting.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\"></h2>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Planning a large or long-term cooling job?</strong> Send us your load, hire period and what condenser water infrastructure you have on site, and we&#8217;ll tell you whether water-cooled is the right call — with delivery within 24 to 48 hours once it&#8217;s agreed. <strong>Call +971 56 921 3754</strong> or request a quote.</p>\n','http://localhost:8000/storage/media/uae-water-cooled.jpg','default','published','Water Cooled Chiller Rental in UAE - Rental Power and Rental Cooling in UAE','Stay cool with our cost-effective rental cooling services. Ideal for everything from events to workspaces. Water cooled chiller rental UAE',NULL,'https://rentalpower.ae/products/water-cooled-chiller-rental-uae/','Water Cooled Chiller Rental in UAE - Rental Power and Rental Cooling in UAE','Stay cool with our cost-effective rental cooling services. Ideal for everything from events to workspaces. Water cooled chiller rental UAE','http://localhost:8000/storage/media/uae-water-cooled.jpg',1,'water cooled chiller rental in uae',91,100,'2026-10-17 04:49:55','2026-10-18 02:18:09',NULL),(157,1,'Air Cooled Chiller Rental in UAE','products/air-cooled-chiller-rental-uae','<p dir=\"ltr\">An air-cooled chiller removes heat from a water or glycol loop and rejects it straight into the outside air, which means no cooling tower, no condenser water supply and no plant room. That makes it the default choice for temporary cooling across the UAE, where sites need cooling fast and rarely have spare water infrastructure to connect to. Units arrive as a self-contained package, are positioned in open air, connected to chilled water hoses and power, and are running the same day.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">What Makes This Equipment Different?</h2>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">The difference is what it does <em>not</em> need. A water-cooled chiller needs a cooling tower, condenser pumps, treated make-up water and somewhere to put it all. An air-cooled unit needs a clear outdoor position with airflow, power and two hose connections.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">That trade-off is straightforward: air-cooled units are less efficient at the chiller itself, but they install in hours rather than days and carry no water treatment or tower maintenance. Air-cooled chiller plants run at roughly 1.2 to 1.5 kW per ton of cooling against roughly 0.55 to 0.85 kW per ton for water-cooled plants, depending on the unit and operating conditions.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">For temporary hire, where the job lasts weeks or months rather than decades, speed of deployment usually matters more than the efficiency gap. That&#8217;s why air-cooled is what most UAE rental fleets stock in depth.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">The other thing that matters here is ambient rating. A standard chiller loses capacity as outside air heats up, and UAE summers regularly push past 45°C. High-ambient units are built to hold rated output in that heat — rental-spec machines are commonly rated to 50–55°C ambient. Always confirm the ambient rating before hiring, not just the tonnage.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">Key Specifications</h2>\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"col\">Specification</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Capacity range</td>\n<td>Around 10 TR to 400+ TR available on the UAE rental market</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ambient rating</td>\n<td>High-ambient units rated up to 50–55°C</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Leaving water temperature</td>\n<td>Adjustable; below 0°C available on glycol duty</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Compressor type</td>\n<td>Scroll on smaller units, screw on larger units</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Refrigerant</td>\n<td>R134a and R410A are common on rental units</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Power supply</td>\n<td>400V / 3-phase / 50Hz, standard for the UAE</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Condenser</td>\n<td>Air-cooled, fan-driven; no cooling tower or condenser water required</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Control</td>\n<td>Digital controller with fault protection and set-point control</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mounting</td>\n<td>Skid or trailer mounted</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><em>Exact specifications vary by unit and are confirmed at the time of enquiry based on your load and site conditions.</em></p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">Available Capacities / Options</h2>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Air-cooled chillers are selected by cooling load in tons of refrigeration (TR). One TR is approximately 3.5 kW of cooling.</p>\n<ul dir=\"ltr\">\n<li><strong>Small (around 10–50 TR)</strong> — server rooms, small production lines, single-floor offices, short events</li>\n<li><strong>Mid (around 60–150 TR)</strong> — commercial buildings, mid-size process cooling, exhibitions and marquees</li>\n<li><strong>Large (around 200–400 TR)</strong> — industrial process cooling, plant turnarounds, large venues, district cooling backup</li>\n<li><strong>Multiple units in parallel</strong> — for loads above a single machine&#8217;s output, units are manifolded together, which also gives redundancy if one unit needs service</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">Key Features</h2>\n<ul dir=\"ltr\">\n<li>No cooling tower, condenser water or plant room required</li>\n<li>High-ambient operation suited to UAE summer conditions, with units rated to 50–55°C available</li>\n<li>Self-contained package — connects with hoses and power only</li>\n<li>Installed and commissioned within hours rather than days</li>\n<li>Digital control with stable set-point holding as ambient and flow vary</li>\n<li>Scales by adding units in parallel rather than replacing the machine</li>\n<li>Supplied with the ancillaries needed to run — pumps, hoses, manifolds and buffer tanks quoted with the unit</li>\n<li>Delivery within 24–48 hours, with 24/7 breakdown support for the length of the hire</li>\n<li>Serviced and performance-tested before every hire</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">Applications</h2>\n<ul dir=\"ltr\">\n<li><strong>Building cooling during chiller breakdown</strong> — keeping a hotel, mall or office running while the permanent plant is repaired</li>\n<li><strong>Plant turnarounds and shutdowns</strong> — supplementary process cooling during maintenance windows</li>\n<li><strong>Construction and fit-out</strong> — cooling handover-ready spaces before permanent HVAC is commissioned</li>\n<li><strong>Events and exhibitions</strong> — chilled water for temporary AHUs in marquees and halls</li>\n<li><strong>Manufacturing and process cooling</strong> — holding a process fluid at a set temperature</li>\n<li><strong>Data centres and server rooms</strong> — emergency and supplementary cooling for heat-critical spaces</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">Rental Availability in UAE</h2>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Rental Power supplies air-cooled chillers for short-term and long-term hire across Dubai, Abu Dhabi, Sharjah and the wider UAE, delivered with the pumps, hoses and connections needed to run. This equipment sits within our wider <a href=\"/services/cooling/rental-chiller-in-uae/\">chiller rental in UAE</a> range, so we can move you between capacities or switch to a water-cooled configuration if the duty changes.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">Choosing the Right Option</h2>\n<ul dir=\"ltr\">\n<li><strong>Work out your load first</strong> — cooling duty in TR or kW, not floor area. If you don&#8217;t have it, our team can size from your process or building details.</li>\n<li><strong>Check the ambient rating, not just the tonnage</strong> — a unit rated at 35°C will not deliver its badge capacity in a UAE July.</li>\n<li><strong>Confirm space and airflow</strong> — air-cooled units reject heat upwards and need clearance; a tight courtyard can cause short-cycling.</li>\n<li><strong>Ask about power</strong> — a chiller of any size needs a three-phase supply and correct cabling. We can pair it with a <a href=\"/services/generator/rental-generator-in-uae/\">rental generator</a> if site power isn&#8217;t available.</li>\n<li><strong>For long, high-tonnage duties</strong> — if the job runs many months at high load and water is available, a <a href=\"/products/water-cooled-chiller-rental-uae/\">water-cooled chiller</a> may cost less to run.</li>\n<li><strong>For small or moveable duties</strong> — a <a href=\"/products/portable-chiller-rental-uae/\">portable chiller</a> may be the better fit.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">FAQs</h2>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>How quickly can an air-cooled chiller be installed?</strong> Delivery is typically within 24 to 48 hours of a hire being agreed. Because there&#8217;s no cooling tower or water connection, a unit can then be positioned, connected and commissioned within hours of arriving on site — so from first call to running cooling is usually a matter of days, not weeks.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Do I need a water supply?</strong> No. The chilled water loop is a closed circuit and the condenser rejects heat to air. You only need a top-up for the loop itself.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Will it hold capacity in UAE summer heat?</strong> A high-ambient unit will, within its rated ambient limit. Standard-ambient machines lose output as temperatures climb, which is why rental fleets in this region stock high-ambient models.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Can chillers be combined for a bigger load?</strong> Yes. Multiple units can run in parallel on a common manifold, which also gives you redundancy.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>What&#8217;s included with the rental?</strong> A chiller hire is quoted as a working package: the unit itself plus the pumps, hoses and manifolds needed to connect it, and commissioning on site. Breakdown support runs 24/7 throughout the hire. Exactly what&#8217;s covered for your unit is set out in your quotation.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\"></h2>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Need an air-cooled chiller in the UAE?</strong> Tell us your cooling load, site conditions and hire period, and we&#8217;ll size the right unit and have it on site within 24 to 48 hours. <strong>Call<a href=\"tel: +971 56 921 3754\"> +971 56 921 3754</a></strong> or request a quote.</p>\n','http://localhost:8000/storage/media/14.jpg','default','published','Air Cooled Chiller Rental in UAE - Rental Power and Rental Cooling in UAE','Our Air cooled chiller rental UAE solutions are perfect for events, offices, and residential use. Book your rental today!+971 56 921 3754',NULL,'https://rentalpower.ae/products/air-cooled-chiller-rental-uae/','Air Cooled Chiller Rental in UAE - Rental Power and Rental Cooling in UAE','Our Air cooled chiller rental UAE solutions are perfect for events, offices, and residential use. Book your rental today!+971 56 921 3754','http://localhost:8000/storage/media/14.jpg',1,'air cooled chiller rental in uae',91,100,'2026-10-17 04:49:55','2026-10-18 02:18:09',NULL),(158,1,'Air Cooled Chiller Rental in UAE','air-cooled-chiller-rental-uae','<p dir=\"ltr\">An air-cooled chiller removes heat from a water or glycol loop and rejects it straight into the outside air, which means no cooling tower, no condenser water supply and no plant room. That makes it the default choice for temporary cooling across the UAE, where sites need cooling fast and rarely have spare water infrastructure to connect to. Units arrive as a self-contained package, are positioned in open air, connected to chilled water hoses and power, and are running the same day.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">What Makes This Equipment Different?</h2>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">The difference is what it does <em>not</em> need. A water-cooled chiller needs a cooling tower, condenser pumps, treated make-up water and somewhere to put it all. An air-cooled unit needs a clear outdoor position with airflow, power and two hose connections.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">That trade-off is straightforward: air-cooled units are less efficient at the chiller itself, but they install in hours rather than days and carry no water treatment or tower maintenance. Air-cooled chiller plants run at roughly 1.2 to 1.5 kW per ton of cooling against roughly 0.55 to 0.85 kW per ton for water-cooled plants, depending on the unit and operating conditions.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">For temporary hire, where the job lasts weeks or months rather than decades, speed of deployment usually matters more than the efficiency gap. That&#8217;s why air-cooled is what most UAE rental fleets stock in depth.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">The other thing that matters here is ambient rating. A standard chiller loses capacity as outside air heats up, and UAE summers regularly push past 45°C. High-ambient units are built to hold rated output in that heat — rental-spec machines are commonly rated to 50–55°C ambient. Always confirm the ambient rating before hiring, not just the tonnage.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">Key Specifications</h2>\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"col\">Specification</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Capacity range</td>\n<td>Around 10 TR to 400+ TR available on the UAE rental market</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ambient rating</td>\n<td>High-ambient units rated up to 50–55°C</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Leaving water temperature</td>\n<td>Adjustable; below 0°C available on glycol duty</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Compressor type</td>\n<td>Scroll on smaller units, screw on larger units</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Refrigerant</td>\n<td>R134a and R410A are common on rental units</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Power supply</td>\n<td>400V / 3-phase / 50Hz, standard for the UAE</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Condenser</td>\n<td>Air-cooled, fan-driven; no cooling tower or condenser water required</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Control</td>\n<td>Digital controller with fault protection and set-point control</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mounting</td>\n<td>Skid or trailer mounted</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><em>Exact specifications vary by unit and are confirmed at the time of enquiry based on your load and site conditions.</em></p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">Available Capacities / Options</h2>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Air-cooled chillers are selected by cooling load in tons of refrigeration (TR). One TR is approximately 3.5 kW of cooling.</p>\n<ul dir=\"ltr\">\n<li><strong>Small (around 10–50 TR)</strong> — server rooms, small production lines, single-floor offices, short events</li>\n<li><strong>Mid (around 60–150 TR)</strong> — commercial buildings, mid-size process cooling, exhibitions and marquees</li>\n<li><strong>Large (around 200–400 TR)</strong> — industrial process cooling, plant turnarounds, large venues, district cooling backup</li>\n<li><strong>Multiple units in parallel</strong> — for loads above a single machine&#8217;s output, units are manifolded together, which also gives redundancy if one unit needs service</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">Key Features</h2>\n<ul dir=\"ltr\">\n<li>No cooling tower, condenser water or plant room required</li>\n<li>High-ambient operation suited to UAE summer conditions, with units rated to 50–55°C available</li>\n<li>Self-contained package — connects with hoses and power only</li>\n<li>Installed and commissioned within hours rather than days</li>\n<li>Digital control with stable set-point holding as ambient and flow vary</li>\n<li>Scales by adding units in parallel rather than replacing the machine</li>\n<li>Supplied with the ancillaries needed to run — pumps, hoses, manifolds and buffer tanks quoted with the unit</li>\n<li>Delivery within 24–48 hours, with 24/7 breakdown support for the length of the hire</li>\n<li>Serviced and performance-tested before every hire</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">Applications</h2>\n<ul dir=\"ltr\">\n<li><strong>Building cooling during chiller breakdown</strong> — keeping a hotel, mall or office running while the permanent plant is repaired</li>\n<li><strong>Plant turnarounds and shutdowns</strong> — supplementary process cooling during maintenance windows</li>\n<li><strong>Construction and fit-out</strong> — cooling handover-ready spaces before permanent HVAC is commissioned</li>\n<li><strong>Events and exhibitions</strong> — chilled water for temporary AHUs in marquees and halls</li>\n<li><strong>Manufacturing and process cooling</strong> — holding a process fluid at a set temperature</li>\n<li><strong>Data centres and server rooms</strong> — emergency and supplementary cooling for heat-critical spaces</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">Rental Availability in UAE</h2>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Rental Power supplies air-cooled chillers for short-term and long-term hire across Dubai, Abu Dhabi, Sharjah and the wider UAE, delivered with the pumps, hoses and connections needed to run. This equipment sits within our wider <a href=\"/services/cooling/rental-chiller-in-uae/\">chiller rental in UAE</a> range, so we can move you between capacities or switch to a water-cooled configuration if the duty changes.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">Choosing the Right Option</h2>\n<ul dir=\"ltr\">\n<li><strong>Work out your load first</strong> — cooling duty in TR or kW, not floor area. If you don&#8217;t have it, our team can size from your process or building details.</li>\n<li><strong>Check the ambient rating, not just the tonnage</strong> — a unit rated at 35°C will not deliver its badge capacity in a UAE July.</li>\n<li><strong>Confirm space and airflow</strong> — air-cooled units reject heat upwards and need clearance; a tight courtyard can cause short-cycling.</li>\n<li><strong>Ask about power</strong> — a chiller of any size needs a three-phase supply 