INSERT INTO `services` VALUES (40,'Packaged AC Units Rental UAE','packaged-ac-units-rental-uae','10 TR to 100 TR Heavy Industrial Rooftop & Skid-Mounted Packaged AC Units in UAE','Heavy Commercial HVAC • 10 TR to 100 TR Packaged Units','shield-check','High-capacity packaged AC units rental across Dubai, Abu Dhabi, and Sharjah ranging from 10 TR to 100 TR. Engineered for high-volume ducted cooling in warehouses, factory expansions, exhibition marquees, and construction compounds.','<div class=\"space-y-8\">\n    <p class=\"text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-700 leading-relaxed font-normal\">\n        <strong>Rental Power UAE</strong> supplies heavy-duty, skid-mounted and rooftop <strong>packaged AC units rental in the UAE</strong>, offering high-volume temporary air conditioning packages ranging from <strong>10 TR to 100 TR</strong> per unit. Designed for large open spaces, high-ceiling facilities, exhibition domes, and industrial manufacturing plants, our packaged air conditioning systems deliver hundreds of thousands of BTUs of conditioned cold air via durable canvas ducting networks across <a href=\"/locations/dubai\" class=\"text-amber-700 hover:text-amber-800 underline font-semibold\">Dubai</a>, <a href=\"/locations/abu-dhabi\" class=\"text-amber-700 hover:text-amber-800 underline font-semibold\">Abu Dhabi</a>, and <a href=\"/locations/sharjah\" class=\"text-amber-700 hover:text-amber-800 underline font-semibold\">Sharjah</a>.\n    </p>\n\n    <h2>1. What Is a Packaged Air Conditioning Unit?</h2>\n<figure class=\"my-8 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm border border-slate-200 not-prose bg-white\">\n    <img src=\"/storage/media/Packaged-ac-unit-rental-in-uae.webp\" alt=\"High-Capacity Packaged Air Conditioning Unit on Site\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"w-full h-auto object-cover max-h-[460px]\">\n    <figcaption class=\"p-3 bg-slate-50 text-center text-xs text-slate-600 font-medium border-t border-slate-100\">\n        Industrial rooftop packaged AC rental installation in Dubai industrial facility.\n    </figcaption>\n</figure>\n\n    <p>\n        Unlike split systems where the compressor and evaporator coils are separated, a packaged AC unit integrates the compressor, condenser coils, evaporator blower, and digital controls inside a single weather-tight steel enclosure. This self-contained architecture delivers multiple strategic advantages for temporary and semi-permanent HVAC applications:\n    </p>\n    <ul>\n        <li><strong>Zero Refrigerant Piping On-Site:</strong> The entire refrigeration cycle is factory-sealed and pressure-tested, eliminating copper brazing, vacuum pulling, or refrigerant charging at your facility.</li>\n        <li><strong>External Placement & Zero Footprint Loss:</strong> Positioned outdoors on grade or on rooftops, delivering cold supply air and drawing warm return air through flexible spiral-wire canvas ducting, preserving 100% of valuable interior floor space.</li>\n        <li><strong>Massive Static Pressure & Long Air Throws:</strong> Equipped with backward-curved centrifugal fans capable of pushing conditioned air across 50 to 100 meters of ducting with minimal pressure loss.</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <h3>Packaged AC Fleet Specifications Table</h3>\n    <div class=\"overflow-x-auto my-6 not-prose\">\n        <table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-sm border-collapse border border-slate-200 rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-xs\">\n            <thead class=\"bg-slate-900 text-white font-bold uppercase text-[11px] tracking-wider\">\n                <tr>\n                    <th class=\"p-3 border border-slate-800\">Unit Capacity</th>\n                    <th class=\"p-3 border border-slate-800\">Cooling Output (BTU/hr)</th>\n                    <th class=\"p-3 border border-slate-800\">Airflow Volume (CFM)</th>\n                    <th class=\"p-3 border border-slate-800\">External Static (Pa)</th>\n                    <th class=\"p-3 border border-slate-800\">Electrical Demand</th>\n                    <th class=\"p-3 border border-slate-800\">Duct Connections</th>\n                </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody class=\"divide-y divide-slate-100 bg-white\">\n                <tr class=\"hover:bg-slate-50\">\n                    <td class=\"p-3 font-bold text-slate-900\">10 TR Packaged Unit</td>\n                    <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-700\">120,000 BTU/hr</td>\n                    <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-600\">4,000 CFM</td>\n                    <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-600\">250 Pa</td>\n                    <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-700\">14 kW / 25A (400V)</td>\n                    <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-700\">2 &times; 16\" Supply / Return</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr class=\"hover:bg-slate-50 bg-slate-50/50\">\n                    <td class=\"p-3 font-bold text-slate-900\">25 TR Industrial Skid</td>\n                    <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-700\">300,000 BTU/hr</td>\n                    <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-600\">9,500 CFM</td>\n                    <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-600\">350 Pa</td>\n                    <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-700\">34 kW / 58A (400V)</td>\n                    <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-700\">2 &times; 20\" Supply / Return</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr class=\"hover:bg-slate-50\">\n                    <td class=\"p-3 font-bold text-slate-900\">50 TR Heavy Duty Unit</td>\n                    <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-700\">600,000 BTU/hr</td>\n                    <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-600\">18,000 CFM</td>\n                    <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-600\">500 Pa</td>\n                    <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-700\">68 kW / 115A (400V)</td>\n                    <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-700\">4 &times; 20\" Supply / Return</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr class=\"hover:bg-slate-50 bg-slate-50/50\">\n                    <td class=\"p-3 font-bold text-slate-900\">100 TR High-Tonnage Plant</td>\n                    <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-700\">1,200,000 BTU/hr</td>\n                    <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-600\">36,000 CFM</td>\n                    <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-600\">650 Pa</td>\n                    <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-700\">135 kW / 225A (400V)</td>\n                    <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-700\">Multi-Port 24\" Plenum</td>\n                </tr>\n            </tbody>\n        </table>\n    </div>\n\n    <h2>2. Tropical 52°C Engineering for Middle East Climates</h2>\n    <p>\n        In industrial areas like Dubai Industrial City, JAFZA, and Mussafah, ambient air temperatures frequently surge above 48°C, with direct sunlight heating steel rooftops and parking pads to over 65°C.\n    </p>\n    <p>\n        Rental Power UAE packaged units are purpose-built with:\n    </p>\n    <ul>\n        <li><strong>Hydrophilic Blue-Fin Coils:</strong> Anti-corrosion condenser fin coatings that repel salt mist, desert silica sand, and aggressive petrochemical airborne contaminants.</li>\n        <li><strong>Dual Hermetic/Semi-Hermetic Scroll & Screw Compressors:</strong> Equipped with tandem independent refrigeration circuits offering built-in 50% redundancy. If one circuit undergoes maintenance, the second circuit continues delivering chilled air.</li>\n        <li><strong>Multi-Stage Microprocessor Control:</strong> Automatically stages compressors based on thermal load, reducing diesel generator fuel consumption and electrical peak demand during cooler evening hours.</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <h2>3. Flexible Ducting & Air Distribution Engineering</h2>\n    <p>\n        Effective cooling depends equally on proper air distribution. Our technical team engineers custom air distribution schemes for each project:\n    </p>\n    <ul>\n        <li><strong>Flame-Retardant Insulated Ducting:</strong> Heavy-duty PVC-coated canvas ducts featuring spiral spring-steel wire reinforcement and internal fiberglass insulation to prevent thermal loss and condensation sweating.</li>\n        <li><strong>Perforated Fabric Air Sox (Jet Nozzles):</strong> Lightweight fabric duct sleeves suspended from roof trusses, delivering uniform, draft-free laminar air diffusion across large warehouse floors without hot spots.</li>\n        <li><strong>Quick-Connect Transition Boxes:</strong> Heavy-gauge galvanized metal plenum boxes with multi-spigot collars for splitting main airflows into individual office rooms or partitioned zones.</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <h2>4. Applications: Events, Construction Fit-Outs & Plant Turnarounds</h2>\n    <p>\n        Our packaged air conditioning units serve demanding temporary cooling requirements across the Emirates:\n    </p>\n    <ul>\n        <li><strong>Exhibition Marquees & Royal Weddings:</strong> Supplying silent, high-volume climate control to temporary tents and clear-span structures for high-profile international events in Dubai and Abu Dhabi.</li>\n        <li><strong>Industrial Plant Overhauls & Maintenance:</strong> Providing fresh, cool ventilation air for confined-space maintenance teams working inside boilers, storage tanks, and refinery vessels.</li>\n        <li><strong>Interim Cooling During HVAC Retrofits:</strong> Keeping shopping centers, logistics depots, and corporate headquarters comfortable while existing rooftop chillers or packaged units are being replaced. Explore our <a href=\"/service/rental-chiller-in-uae\">chiller rental fleet</a> for central hydronic alternatives.</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <h2>5. Frequently Asked Questions (Packaged AC Hire)</h2>\n\n    <h3>Can packaged AC units provide 100% fresh air rather than recirculated air?</h3>\n    <p>\n        Yes. Our units feature motorized modulating fresh air dampers adjustable from 0% to 100% outside air intake. For industrial welding areas, paint booths, and healthcare screening facilities, we configure 100% full fresh air with high-efficiency particulate air filtration.\n    </p>\n\n    <h3>What generator capacity is needed to power a 50 TR packaged AC unit?</h3>\n    <p>\n        A 50 TR packaged unit draws approximately 68 kW running load with an inductive compressor startup current of roughly 220 Amps. To ensure safe motor starting without voltage dips, we recommend pairing with our <a href=\"/fleet/100-kva-generator-rental\">100 kVA soundproof generator</a> or <a href=\"/fleet/150-kva-generator-rental\">150 kVA generator</a> for multi-unit clusters.\n    </p>\n\n    <h3>How are the units transported and lifted onto site?</h3>\n    <p>\n        All packaged units are built within structural skid frames equipped with four-point crane lifting shackles and heavy-duty forklift slots. Rental Power UAE provides complete boom crane flatbed logistics, on-site rigging, and certified electrical cabling.\n    </p>\n\n    <h2>Reserve Your Packaged AC Rental in UAE</h2>\n    <p>\n        Contact our specialized commercial cooling engineers today at <strong>+971 56 921 3754</strong> or request a fast quote via our <a href=\"/contact-us\">inquiry portal</a> to secure high-tonnage packaged AC units for your upcoming UAE project.\n    </p>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"my-8 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm border border-slate-200 not-prose bg-white\">\n    <img src=\"/storage/media/tc-in-uae.jpg\" alt=\"Temporary Ducting and Packaged Cooling System\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"w-full h-auto object-cover max-h-[460px]\">\n    <figcaption class=\"p-3 bg-slate-50 text-center text-xs text-slate-600 font-medium border-t border-slate-100\">\n        Flexible duct distribution connected to commercial packaged air conditioning unit.\n    </figcaption>\n</figure>','[\"Skid-mounted heavy-duty packaged DX units from 10 Ton to 50 Ton single and paired units\", \"High-ambient compressors (Copeland/Danfoss) rated for continuous operation at 52°C ambient\", \"High external static pressure (ESP) blowers capable of pushing conditioned air through 100m+ duct runs\", \"Flame-retardant flexible ducting in 12-inch to 24-inch diameters with transition plenums and diffusers\", \"Integrated electrical disconnect switches, phase reverse protection, and high/low pressure cutoffs\", \"Robust lifting frames with fork pockets and certified crane lifting eyes for easy positioning\"]','[\"Eliminates the complexity of chilled water piping: 100% direct expansion air cooling ready in minutes\", \"Ideal for large volume open spaces: warehouses, distribution centers, aircraft hangars, and sports tents\", \"Dramatically reduces indoor humidity levels, preventing mold and condensation during UAE summer\", \"Supplied with matched diesel generators and fuel tanks for completely off-grid operation\"]',NULL,'storage/media/packaged-ac-units-for-rent.jpg','published',5,1,'packaged ac units rental uae','Packaged AC Units Rental UAE | 10–100 TR Rooftop & Skid AC Dubai','Packaged AC units rental in UAE: 10 TR to 100 TR heavy-duty rooftop & skid-mounted packaged air conditioners for warehouses, tents & industrial sites across Dubai & Abu Dhabi.','Packaged AC Units Rental UAE, temporary cooling uae, rental chiller dubai, packaged ac rental uae, rental power uae','https://rentalpower.ae/services/cooling/packaged-ac-units-rental-uae/','Packaged AC Units Rental UAE | Rooftop Package AC Hire',': Rent packaged AC units in UAE - 3 to 30+ ton rooftop package AC rental for events, construction & commercial cooling.','storage/media/packaged-ac-units-for-rent.jpg',1,87,85,'2026-10-17 04:49:54','2026-10-19 10:22:37',NULL),(41,'Portacabin for Sale in UAE','portacabin-for-sale-in-uae','Portacabin for Sale in UAE | Certified Pre-Owned Site Offices, Security & Accommodation Cabins','Used & Refurbished Modular Cabins • Buy & Sell in UAE • Instant Delivery & Crane Lifting','home','Turnkey purchase, refurbishment, and sale of used portacabins across Dubai, Abu Dhabi, and Sharjah. Heavy-duty 10x10ft security cabins, 20x10ft site offices, and 40x10ft executive modular offices with instant crane delivery.','<div class=\"space-y-10\">\n\n    <!-- Executive Overview & Commercial Trading Scope -->\n    <section class=\"space-y-4\">\n        <h2 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight font-display\">\n            We Buy & Sell Used, Refurbished & Scrap Portacabins Across the UAE\n        </h2>\n<figure class=\"my-8 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm border border-slate-200 not-prose bg-white\">\n    <img src=\"/storage/media/portable-office-cabin.webp\" alt=\"Modular Site Office Portacabin in UAE\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"w-full h-auto object-cover max-h-[460px]\">\n    <figcaption class=\"p-3 bg-slate-50 text-center text-xs text-slate-600 font-medium border-t border-slate-100\">\n        Certified prefabricated site office cabin with steel skid frame and PU sandwich panel insulation.\n    </figcaption>\n</figure>\n\n        <p class=\"text-slate-600 leading-relaxed text-base\">\n            Temporary modular buildings, prefabricated site offices, and portable cabins form the operational backbone of every civil engineering, infrastructure, and industrial project across the United Arab Emirates. However, once major construction contracts conclude or oilfield camps demobilize, contractors are faced with expensive yard storage costs, land lease penalties, and deteriorating surplus structures.\n        </p>\n        <p class=\"text-slate-600 leading-relaxed text-base font-semibold text-slate-800\">\n            At <strong>Rental Power UAE</strong>, we operate the country’s leading <strong>Portacabin Buy & Sell Division</strong>. We buy used and refurbished portacabins, and also scrap portacabins we buy in any structural condition across Dubai, Abu Dhabi, Sharjah, and all seven Emirates. In addition, we sale high-grade, fully certified refurbished portacabins ready for immediate jobsite deployment.\n        </p>\n        <p class=\"text-slate-600 leading-relaxed text-base\">\n            Whether your project requires immediate cash liquidation for 50 surplus accommodation cabins or you are searching for turnkey, Grade-A executive office cabins fitted with PU sandwich panels, certified electricals, and air conditioning at <strong>50% below new modular manufacturing prices</strong>, our commercial and engineering teams deliver fast, reliable solutions with same-day financial settlement.\n        </p>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Comprehensive Buy & Sell Spectrum -->\n    <section class=\"space-y-6\">\n        <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight font-display\">\n            Full Portacabin Trading Spectrum: What We Buy & What We Sell\n        </h2>\n        <p class=\"text-slate-600 leading-relaxed\">\n            Operating extensive storage and refurbishment facilities in the Sajaa Industrial Oasis (Sharjah) and Jebel Ali / Al Quoz (Dubai), we handle modular prefabricated structures across all categories:\n        </p>\n\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 not-prose my-6\">\n            <div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 space-y-3\">\n                <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-700 flex items-center justify-center font-bold\">01</div>\n                <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900\">We Buy Used Portacabins</h3>\n                <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed\">\n                    We purchase operational, second-hand modular cabins directly from contracting companies, developers, and project joint ventures. We actively buy executive site office cabins, meeting units, supervisor offices, staff dining halls, and multi-cubicle ablution units in sizes including 10x10ft, 20x10ft, 30x10ft, 40x10ft, and 40x12ft.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 space-y-3\">\n                <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-rose-500/10 text-rose-700 flex items-center justify-center font-bold\">02</div>\n                <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900\">We Buy Scrap Portacabins</h3>\n                <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed\">\n                    We buy structurally damaged, rusted, fire-impacted, decayed, water-damaged, or condemned portacabins. When structures are no longer habitable or viable for commercial reuse, we purchase them for scrap metal salvage—valuing heavy I-beam structural steel chassis, galvanized corrugated roof sheets, and aluminum window frames.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 space-y-3\">\n                <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-700 flex items-center justify-center font-bold\">03</div>\n                <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900\">We Sale Refurbished Portacabins</h3>\n                <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed\">\n                    We sale fully reconditioned, Grade-A modular cabins that look and perform like brand-new units. Refurbished portacabins feature sandblasted anti-corrosion structural frames, new 50mm–100mm PU sandwich panels, commercial vinyl floors, certified DEWA/SEWA compliant electrical distribution boards, and heavy-duty split ACs.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Architectural & Engineering Reconditioning Standards -->\n    <section class=\"space-y-4\">\n        <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight font-display\">\n            Engineering & Fabrication Standards: How We Refurbish Modular Cabins\n        </h2>\n        <p class=\"text-slate-600 leading-relaxed\">\n            The UAE\'s extreme climate—featuring summer ambient temperatures exceeding 50°C, intense solar radiation, and corrosive coastal humidity—quickly destroys poorly built portacabins. Every cabin refurbished and sold by Rental Power UAE undergoes a comprehensive structural, thermal, and electrical reconstruction process:\n        </p>\n\n        <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-800 tracking-tight mt-4\">1. Structural Skid Chassis Restoration & Anti-Corrosion Treatment</h3>\n        <p class=\"text-slate-600 leading-relaxed\">\n            The structural foundation of any portable cabin is its steel chassis. We inspect the main I-beam runners, cross-members, and corner lifting lugs. Damaged or rusted members are cut out and replaced with heavy structural channel steel. The entire steel undercarriage is sandblasted to remove rust scale and treated with zinc-phosphate anti-corrosion primer followed by marine-grade bituminous protective paint.\n        </p>\n\n        <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-800 tracking-tight mt-4\">2. High-Performance Thermal Insulation: PU & Rockwool Sandwich Panels</h3>\n        <p class=\"text-slate-600 leading-relaxed\">\n            Standard corrugated sheet cabins become unbearable heat traps in Dubai and Abu Dhabi. In our refurbishment line, we fit walls and ceilings with continuous high-density Polyurethane (PU) foam core or non-combustible Rockwool sandwich panels (density 40 kg/m³, thermal conductivity &lambda; &le; 0.022 W/m&middot;K). With panel thicknesses of 50mm, 75mm, or 100mm, our cabins maintain cool interior temperatures while reducing air conditioning power consumption by up to 45%.\n        </p>\n\n        <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-800 tracking-tight mt-4\">3. Heavy-Duty Subfloor & Commercial Grade Vinyl Flooring</h3>\n        <p class=\"text-slate-600 leading-relaxed\">\n            Termite infestation and water ingress frequently rot subfloors in older cabins. We replace compromised subflooring with 18mm high-density marine plywood or fiber-cement boards bolted directly to the steel joists. Surfaces are sealed with heavy-duty commercial vinyl sheeting (2.0mm to 3.0mm thickness) with hot-welded seams, offering superior slip resistance, easy mopping, and exceptional durability under heavy work boot traffic.\n        </p>\n\n        <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-800 tracking-tight mt-4\">4. Certified Electrical Wiring & Distribution Boards (DEWA / SEWA Standard)</h3>\n        <p class=\"text-slate-600 leading-relaxed\">\n            Safety is paramount on construction job sites. We strip out hazardous, exposed wiring and install brand-new, fire-retardant PVC surface trunking or concealed conduit. Electrical infrastructure includes an industrial main distribution board (MDB/SMDB) fitted with Schneider or ABB residual current circuit breakers (RCCB 30mA protection), British Standard 13A dual switched sockets, dedicated 20A AC isolators, and energy-efficient LED batten lights.\n        </p>\n\n        <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-800 tracking-tight mt-4\">5. Climate Control & Sanitary Ablution Integration</h3>\n        <p class=\"text-slate-600 leading-relaxed\">\n            Every executive cabin or site office is fitted with pre-fabricated structural cutouts and support brackets for 1.5-ton to 2.5-ton rotary/tropical split air conditioning units designed to operate in high ambient temperatures. For ablution and toilet blocks, we install UPVC drainage systems, PPR hot/cold water piping, ceramic water closets, wash basins with brass mixer taps, high-flow exhaust ventilation fans, and shatterproof mirrors.\n        </p>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Technical Comparison Matrix -->\n    <section class=\"space-y-4\">\n        <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight font-display\">\n            Comparison: Used Portacabins vs. Refurbished Cabins vs. Brand-New Prefabricated Units\n        </h2>\n        <p class=\"text-slate-600 leading-relaxed\">\n            Evaluate your project’s modular infrastructure investment options across cost, delivery time, structural lifespan, and buyback value:\n        </p>\n\n        <div class=\"overflow-x-auto my-6 not-prose\">\n            <table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-sm border-collapse border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl shadow-xs overflow-hidden\">\n                <thead class=\"bg-slate-900 text-white font-bold uppercase text-[11px] tracking-wider\">\n                    <tr>\n                        <th class=\"p-3.5 border border-slate-800\">Evaluation Parameter</th>\n                        <th class=\"p-3.5 border border-slate-800\">Certified Used Portacabin</th>\n                        <th class=\"p-3.5 border border-slate-800\">Refurbished Cabin (RP UAE)</th>\n                        <th class=\"p-3.5 border border-slate-800\">Brand-New Custom Fabricated</th>\n                    </tr>\n                </thead>\n                <tbody class=\"divide-y divide-slate-100 bg-white\">\n                    <tr class=\"hover:bg-slate-50\">\n                        <td class=\"p-3.5 font-bold text-slate-900\">Procurement Price</td>\n                        <td class=\"p-3.5 text-emerald-600 font-bold\">50% &ndash; 65% Below New Price</td>\n                        <td class=\"p-3.5 text-emerald-600 font-bold\">40% &ndash; 50% Below New Price</td>\n                        <td class=\"p-3.5 text-rose-600 font-semibold\">100% Full Factory CAPEX</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr class=\"hover:bg-slate-50 bg-slate-50/50\">\n                        <td class=\"p-3.5 font-bold text-slate-900\">Delivery Lead Time</td>\n                        <td class=\"p-3.5 text-emerald-600 font-bold\">Immediate (24 &ndash; 48 Hours)</td>\n                        <td class=\"p-3.5 text-emerald-600 font-bold\">In-Stock Dispatch (48 Hours)</td>\n                        <td class=\"p-3.5 text-rose-600 font-semibold\">4 &ndash; 8 Weeks Factory Build</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr class=\"hover:bg-slate-50\">\n                        <td class=\"p-3.5 font-bold text-slate-900\">Thermal Insulation State</td>\n                        <td class=\"p-3.5 text-slate-600\">Existing Sound Panels</td>\n                        <td class=\"p-3.5 text-slate-900 font-semibold\">Brand-New 50mm–100mm PU Panels</td>\n                        <td class=\"p-3.5 text-slate-900\">New Factory Panels</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr class=\"hover:bg-slate-50 bg-slate-50/50\">\n                        <td class=\"p-3.5 font-bold text-slate-900\">Electrical System Condition</td>\n                        <td class=\"p-3.5 text-slate-600\">Inspected & Megger Tested</td>\n                        <td class=\"p-3.5 text-slate-900 font-semibold\">100% Rewired with DB & LED</td>\n                        <td class=\"p-3.5 text-slate-900\">Brand-New Factory Install</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr class=\"hover:bg-slate-50\">\n                        <td class=\"p-3.5 font-bold text-slate-900\">Expected Working Lifespan</td>\n                        <td class=\"p-3.5 text-slate-600\">3 to 5 Years</td>\n                        <td class=\"p-3.5 text-emerald-600 font-bold\">7 to 10+ Years with Maintenance</td>\n                        <td class=\"p-3.5 text-slate-900\">10 to 12 Years</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr class=\"hover:bg-slate-50 bg-slate-50/50\">\n                        <td class=\"p-3.5 font-bold text-slate-900\">Guaranteed Buyback Option</td>\n                        <td class=\"p-3.5 text-emerald-600 font-bold\">Yes &bull; Contractual Cash Buyback</td>\n                        <td class=\"p-3.5 text-emerald-600 font-bold\">Yes &bull; Contractual Cash Buyback</td>\n                        <td class=\"p-3.5 text-slate-500\">Subject to Third-Party Appraisal</td>\n                    </tr>\n                </tbody>\n            </table>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Turnkey Demobilization, Crane Rigging & Transport -->\n    <section class=\"space-y-4\">\n        <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight font-display\">\n            Full Site Demobilization: Heavy Cranes, Flatbeds & Instant Cash Settlement\n        </h2>\n        <p class=\"text-slate-600 leading-relaxed\">\n            Clearing an active construction compound or remote temporary facility at the conclusion of a project requires coordinated logistics. Demobilizing 10, 20, or 50 portacabins under strict developer deadlines demands heavy lifting gear and licensed haulage. When you sell used or scrap cabins to Rental Power UAE:\n        </p>\n        <ul class=\"list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-slate-600\">\n            <li><strong>Certified Mobile Crane Operations:</strong> We deploy 25-ton to 70-ton mobile cranes equipped with certified 4-leg wire rope lifting bridles and spreader beams. Cabins are rigged and hoisted safely without structural racking or roof puncture.</li>\n            <li><strong>Low-Bed & Flatbed Haulage Fleet:</strong> We operate our own dedicated transport fleet, securing oversized cargo permits from the Roads and Transport Authority (RTA) in Dubai and the Department of Municipalities and Transport (DMT) in Abu Dhabi.</li>\n            <li><strong>Complete Compound Demobilization:</strong> If you have an entire site setup containing office cabins, security guard houses, steel storage containers, ablution blocks, and perimeter fencing, our demolition and removal crews clear the ground completely in days, leaving the plot ready for municipal handover.</li>\n            <li><strong>Upfront Financial Clearance:</strong> 100% of the agreed valuation is settled prior to lifting. We provide instant corporate wire transfers or certified manager\'s cheques.</li>\n        </ul>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Regional Coverage & Response Time -->\n    <section class=\"space-y-4\">\n        <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight font-display\">\n            Prompt Site Inspections Across Dubai, Abu Dhabi, Sharjah & All Emirates\n        </h2>\n        <p class=\"text-slate-600 leading-relaxed\">\n            Our valuation engineers travel througho