ry 12-hour continuous cycle.</li>\n                <li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-emerald-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M5 13l4 4L19 7\"/></svg> Specifically derated for 50°C ambient to avoid engine tripping during peak midday sun.</li>\n                <li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-emerald-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M5 13l4 4L19 7\"/></svg> Required for construction sites, remote desert camps, and off-grid facilities.</li>\n            </ul>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/90 shadow-xs space-y-3\">\n            <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2\">\n                <span class=\"w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-blue-600\"></span>\n                <span>Emergency Standby Power (ESP)</span>\n            </h3>\n            <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed\">\n                <li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-amber-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M5 13l4 4L19 7\"/></svg> Maximum power available for the duration of a utility power outage (DEWA/ADDC).</li>\n                <li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-amber-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M5 13l4 4L19 7\"/></svg> Paired with automatic transfer switch (ATS) panels for seamless under-10-second changeover.</li>\n                <li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\">