       Our rental cooling inventory is powered by tier-1 OEM manufacturers including <strong>Trane, Carrier, York by Johnson Controls, Daikin Applied, and SKM</strong>. Every machine features dual independent refrigeration circuits, variable-speed condenser fans, and digital microprocessor controllers.\n    </p>\n\n    <!-- Technical Specification Table -->\n    <div class=\"overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 my-6 shadow-xs\">\n        <table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-sm\">\n            <thead class=\"bg-slate-900 text-white font-bold uppercase text-[11px] tracking-wider\">\n                <tr>\n                    <th class=\"py-3.5 px-4\">Capacity Range</th>\n                    <th class=\"py-3.5 px-4\">Compressor Architecture</th>\n                    <th class=\"py-3.5 px-4\">Water Flow (m³/hr)</th>\n                    <th class=\"py-3.5 px-4\">Noise (dBA @ 10m)</th>\n                    <th class=\"py-3.5 px-4\">Typical UAE Applications</th>\n                </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody class=\"divide-y divide-slate-100 bg-white\">\n                <tr class=\"hover:bg-slate-50 transition\">\n                    <td class=\"py-3 px-4 font-bold text-amber-900\">50 – 100 TR (175–350 kW)</td>\n                    <td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-slate-600\">Dual Hermetic Scroll (R-410A)</td>\n                    <td class=\"py-3 px-4 font-semibold text-slate-800\">25 – 55 m³/hr</td>\n                    <td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-slate-600\">65 – 68 dBA</td>\n                    <td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-slate-600\">Commercial retail, clinics, server rooms, small VIP events, bakery jacket cooling</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr class=\"hover:bg-slate-50 transition\">\n                    <td class=\"py-3 px-4 font-bold text-amber-900\">150 – 250 TR (525–875 kW)</td>\n                    <td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-slate-600\">Semi-Hermetic Screw (R-134a)</td>\n                    <td class=\"py-3 px-