 stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M5 13l4 4L19 7\"/></svg> Directly connects to existing facility cooling towers or our rental cooling tower packages.</li>\n                <li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-amber-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M5 13l4 4L19 7\"/></svg> Preferred for district cooling central plants, basements, and marine shipboard cooling.</li>\n            </ul>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-black text-slate-900 font-display pt-4\">Turnkey Ancillaries Included with Every Rental Setup</h2>\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 my-6\">\n        <div class=\"p-5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 space-y-2\">\n            <h4 class=\"font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm\">Flexible Chilled Water Hoses</h4>\n            <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed\">\n                Reinforced 16 Bar (PN16) EPDM food-grade flexible hoses equipped with quick-connect Bauer or Cam-Lock couplings in 2\", 4\", 6\", and 8\" diameters for leak-free circulation.\n            </p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"p-5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 space-y-2\">\n            <h4 class=\"font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm\">Secondary Dual-Pump Skids</h4>\n            <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed\">\n                Skid-mounted duty/standby variable frequency drive (VFD) booster pumps with integrated isolation valves, strainers, and digital pressure differential sensors.\n            </p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"p-5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 space-y-2\">\n            <h4 class=\"font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm\">Plate Heat Exchangers (PHE)</h4>\n            <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed\">\n                AISI 316 stainless steel plate heat exchangers that thermally decouple the rental cooling loop from permanent building pipework, preventing contamination and glycol dilution.\n            </p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-black text-slate-900 font-display pt-4\">Frequently Asked Questions: Industrial Chiller Rental UAE</h2>\n    <div class=\"space-y-4 my-6\">\n        <details class=\"group rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 p-5 transition-all\">\n            <summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-sm text-slate-900 cursor-pointer list-none\">\n                <span>What is the rental cost for commercial cooling and chillers in Dubai and UAE?</span>\n                <span class=\"text-amber-600 font-bold group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform\">&#9660;</span>\n            </summary>\n            <div class=\"mt-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed border-t border-slate-200/60 pt-3\">\n                Rental cooling rates depend on capacity (Tons/kW), project duration (daily emergency, weekly, or seasonal monthly contracts), piping distance, and power availability. Long-term contracts include complete 24/7 preventive maintenance, chemical water treatment checks, and round-the-clock emergency swap guarantees. Contact our engineering team for a transparent, itemized quote in 15 minutes.\n            </div>\n        </details>\n        <details class=\"group rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 p-5 transition-all\">\n            <summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-sm text-slate-900 cursor-pointer list-none\">\n                <span>How fast can Rental Power UAE deliver emergency cooling to our site?</span>\n                <span class=\"text-amber-600 font-bold group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform\">&#9660;</span>\n            </summary>\n            <div class=\"mt-3 text-