\">\n                <span>Can rental chillers achieve sub-zero glycol cooling for industrial process plants?</span>\n                <span class=\"text-amber-600 font-bold group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform\">&#9660;</span>\n            </summary>\n            <div class=\"mt-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed border-t border-slate-200/60 pt-3\">\n                Yes. While standard HVAC comfort cooling delivers chilled water at 6°C to 12°C, our specialized <a href=\"/service/industrial-chiller-rental-uae\" class=\"text-amber-700 underline font-semibold\">process chillers</a> can be charged with food-grade polypropylene or ethylene glycol to deliver sub-zero leaving fluid temperatures down to -10°C, tailored for concrete batching, chemical jacket cooling, cold storage, and food manufacturing.\n            </div>\n        </details>\n        <details class=\"group rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 p-5 transition-all\">\n            <summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-sm text-slate-900 cursor-pointer list-none\">\n                <span>Do your chillers and cooling units comply with Dubai Municipality, DEWA, and Estidama standards?</span>\n                <span class=\"text-amber-600 font-bold group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform\">&#9660;</span>\n            </summary>\n            <div class=\"mt-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed border-t border-slate-200/60 pt-3\">\n                Yes. All equipment in our rental cooling inventory is AHRI/Eurovent certified, utilizes eco-friendly non-ozone-depleting refrigerants (R-134a, R-410A, R-32), and features acoustic attenuation compliant with Dubai Municipality residential and commercial noise limits (under 72 dBA at 10 meters).\n            </div>\n        </details>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"my-8 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm border border-slate-200 not-prose bg-white\">\n    <img src=\"/storage/media/water-