pplications</th>\n                </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody class=\"divide-y divide-slate-100 bg-white\">\n                <tr class=\"hover:bg-slate-50 transition\">\n                    <td class=\"py-3 px-4 font-bold text-amber-900\">50 – 100 TR (175–350 kW)</td>\n                    <td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-slate-600\">Dual Hermetic Scroll (R-410A)</td>\n                    <td class=\"py-3 px-4 font-semibold text-slate-800\">25 – 55 m³/hr</td>\n                    <td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-slate-600\">65 – 68 dBA</td>\n                    <td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-slate-600\">Commercial retail, clinics, server rooms, small VIP events, bakery jacket cooling</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr class=\"hover:bg-slate-50 transition\">\n                    <td class=\"py-3 px-4 font-bold text-amber-900\">150 – 250 TR (525–875 kW)</td>\n                    <td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-slate-600\">Semi-Hermetic Screw (R-134a)</td>\n                    <td class=\"py-3 px-4 font-semibold text-slate-800\">80 – 135 m³/hr</td>\n                    <td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-slate-600\">68 – 72 dBA</td>\n                    <td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-slate-600\">Hotel AC backup, commercial office towers, hospital outpatient wings, tent cooling</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr class=\"hover:bg-slate-50 transition\">\n                    <td class=\"py-3 px-4 font-bold text-amber-900\">300 – 500 TR (1,050–1,750 kW)</td>\n                    <td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-slate-600\">Twin VFD Stepless Screw (R-134a)</td>\n                    <td class=\"py-3 px-4 font-semibold text-slate-800\">160 – 270 m³/hr</td>\n                    <td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-slate-600\">72 – 74 dBA</td>\n                    <td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-slate-600\">District cooling augmentation, concrete batching plants, plastic manufacturing</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr class=\"hover:bg-slate-50 transition\">\n             