text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed\">\n                <li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-amber-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M5 13l4 4L19 7\"/></svg> Highest energy efficiency (kW/TR) for multi-month continuous <a href=\"/service/industrial-chiller-rental-uae\" class=\"text-amber-700 underline font-semibold\">industrial chiller deployments</a>.</li>\n                <li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-amber-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M5 13l4 4L19 7\"/></svg> Ultra-compact footprint per cooling ton, ideal where ground footprint is severely restricted.</li>\n                <li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-amber-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M5 13l4 4L19 7\"/></svg> Directly connects to existing facility cooling towers or our rental cooling tower packages.</li>\n                <li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-amber-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M5 13l4 4L19 7\"/></svg> Preferred for district cooling central plants, basements, and marine shipboard cooling.</li>\n            </ul>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-black text-slate-900 font-display pt-4\">Turnkey Ancillaries Included with Every Rental Setup</h2>\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 my-6\">\n        <div class=\"p-5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 space-y-2\">\n            <h4 class=\"font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm\">Flexible Chilled Water Hoses</h4>\n            <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed\">\n                Reinforced 16 Bar (PN16) EPDM food-grade flexible hoses equipped with quick-connect Bauer or Cam-Lock couplings in 2\", 4\", 6\", and 8\" diameters for leak-free circulation.\n            </p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"p-5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 space-y-2\">\n            <h4 class=\"font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm\">Secondary Dual-Pump Skids</h4>\n            <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed\">\n                Skid-mounted duty/standby variable frequency drive (VFD) booster pumps with integrated isolation valves, strainers, and digital pressure differential sensors.\n            </p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"p-5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 space-y-2\">\n            <h4 class=\"font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm\">Plate Heat Exchangers (PHE)</h4>\n            <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed\">\n                AISI 316 stainless steel plate heat exchangers that thermally decouple the rental cooling loop from permanent building pipework, preventing contamination and glycol dilution.\n            </p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-black text-slate-900 font-display pt-4\">Frequently Asked Questions: Rental Cooling Solutions UAE</h2>\n    <div class=\"space-y-4 my-6\">\n        <details class=\"group rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 p-5 transition-all\">\n            <summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-sm text-slate-900 cursor-pointer list-none\">\n                <span>What is the rental cost for commercial cooling and chillers in Dubai and UAE?</span>\n                <span class=\"text-amber-600 font-bold group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform\">&#9660;</span>\n            </summary>\n            <div class=\"mt-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed border-t border-slate-200/60 pt-3\">\n                Rental cooling rates depend on capacity (Tons/kW), project duration (daily emergency, weekly, or seasonal monthly contracts), piping distance, and power availability. Long-term contracts include complete 24/7 preventive maintenance, chemical water treatment checks, and round-the-clock emergency swap guarantees. Contact our engineering team for a transparent, itemized quote in 15 minutes.\n            </div>\n        </details>\n        <details class=\"group rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 p-5 transition-all\">\n            <summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-sm text-slate-900 cursor-pointer list-none\">\n                <span>How fast can Rental Power UAE deliver emergency cooling to our site?</span>\n                <span class=\"text-amber-600 font-bold group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform\">&#9660;</span>\n            </summary>\n            <div class=\"mt-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed border-t border-slate-200/60 pt-3\">\n                For emergency cooling breakdowns in <a href=\"/locations/dubai\" class=\"text-amber-700 underline font-semibold\">Dubai</a>, <a href=\"/locations/abu-dhabi\" class=\"text-amber-700 underline font-semibold\">Abu Dhabi</a>, and <a href=\"/locations/sharjah\" class=\"text-amber-700 underline font-semibold\">Sharjah</a>, our pre-rigged mobile chillers and air handling units can be dispatched within 60 to 120 minutes. Our certified rigging and mechanical technicians handle positioning, hose hookup, hydraulic pressure testing, and flow balancing for same-day cooling restoration.\n            </div>\n        </details>\n        <details class=\"group rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 p-5 transition-all\">\n            <summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-sm text-slate-900 cursor-pointer list-none\">\n                <span>What electrical power supply is needed to operate rental chillers?</span>\n                <span class=\"text-amber-600 font-bold group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform\">&#9660;</span>\n            </summary>\n            <div class=\"mt-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed border-t border-slate-200/60 pt-3\">\n                All our chillers operate on standard UAE 380V – 415V, 3-Phase, 50 Hz power supply. If your facility does not have spare electrical capacity on your main distribution board, Rental Power UAE supplies synchronized <a href=\"/service/rental-generator-in-uae\" class=\"text-amber-700 underline font-semibold\">temporary diesel generators</a> (50 kVA to 2500 kVA), cabling, and fuel tanks as a single turnkey package.\n            </div>\n        </details>\n        <details class=\"group rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 p-5 transition-all\">\n            <summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-sm text-slate-900 cursor-pointer list-none\">\n                <span>Can rental chillers achieve sub-zero glycol cooling for industrial process plants?</span>\n                <span class=\"text-amber-600 font-bold group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform\">&#9660;</span>\n            </summary>\n            <div class=\"mt-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed border-t border-slate-200/60 pt-3\">\n                Yes. While standard HVAC comfort cooling delivers chilled water at 6°C to 12°C, our specialized <a href=\"/service/industrial-chiller-rental-uae\" class=\"text-amber-700 underline font-semibold\">process chillers</a> can be charged with food-grade polypropylene or ethylene glycol to deliver sub-zero leaving fluid temperatures down to -10°C, tailored for concrete batching, chemical jacket cooling, cold storage, and food manufacturing.\n            </div>\n        </details>\n        <details class=\"group rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 p-5 transition-all\">\n            <summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-sm text-slate-900 cursor-pointer list-none\">\n                <span>Do your chillers and cooling units comply with Dubai Municipality, DEWA, and Estidama standards?</span>\n                <span class=\"text-amber-600 font-bold group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform\">&#9660;</span>\n            </summary>\n            <div class=\"mt-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed border-t border-slate-200/60 pt-3\">\n                Yes. All equipment in our rental cooling inventory is AHRI/Eurovent certified, utilizes eco-friendly non-ozone-depleting refrigerants (R-134a, R-410A, R-32), and features acoustic attenuation compliant with Dubai Municipality residential and commercial noise limits (under 72 dBA at 10 meters).\n            </div>\n        </details>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"my-8 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm border border-slate-200 not-prose bg-white\">\n    <img src=\"/storage/media/Chiller-Rental-for-Events-in-UAE.webp\" alt=\"Event & Facility Rental Chiller Mobilization\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"w-full h-auto object-cover max-h-[460px]\">\n    <figcaption class=\"p-3 bg-slate-50 text-center text-xs text-slate-600 font-medium border-t border-slate-100\">\n        Sound-attenuated rental chiller setup supporting high-profile corporate event in Dubai.\n    </figcaption>\n</figure>','[\"Modular air-cooled scroll & screw chillers from 50 TR to 1500 TR capacity with dual refrigeration circuits\", \"Blygold-coated high-efficiency condenser coils designed for 52°C extreme ambient Gulf desert operations\", \"Turnkey chilled water pumping skids with variable frequency drives (VFD) and integrated expansion tanks\", \"Heavy-duty 16-bar flexible rubber hoses with quick-connect Bauer and Cam-Lock couplings for fast hookup\", \"Plate heat exchangers (PHE) to decouple temporary cooling loops from permanent building hydronic systems\", \"Full compliance with Dubai Municipality, DEWA, and ADDC commercial and industrial environmental standards\"]','[\"Immediate thermal relief during summer peak temperatures, equipment breakdowns, or district cooling outages\", \"Turnkey single-source delivery: we supply the chillers, secondary pumps, hoses, generator power, and fuel\", \"Pre-commissioned plug-and-play packages reduce on-site installation time to less than 2 hours\", \"24/7 on-site HVAC technicians and emergency support across Dubai, Abu Dhabi, Sharjah, and all 7 Emirates\"]',NULL,'storage/media/rental-chiller-service-uae.webp','published',1,1,'rental cooling uae','Rental Cooling Solutions UAE | Industrial Chillers & Spot AC','Turnkey rental cooling solutions in Dubai, Abu Dhabi & across UAE. 50–1500 TR chillers, AHUs & spot ACs with 2-hour emergency dispatch. Call +971 56 921 3754.','rental cooling uae, rental cooling dubai, commercial cooling rental, temporary cooling dubai, rental chillers abu dhabi, emergency cooling rental uae, industrial cooling rental, event cooling rental uae',NULL,NULL,NULL,'storage/media/rental-chiller-service-uae.webp',1,84,85,'2026-10-18 01:26:34','2026-10-19 10:22:37',NULL),(57,'Air Cooled Chiller Rental UAE','air-cooled-chiller-rental-uae','50 TR to 500 TR High-Efficiency Air-Cooled Screw Chillers for Hire Across UAE','Self-Contained Chilled Water • 50 TR to 500 TR Units','sparkles','Premium air cooled chiller rental in UAE. Self-contained industrial screw chillers ranging from 50 TR to 500 TR for commercial building HVAC, industrial batch cooling, and emergency shutdown backup across Dubai, Abu Dhabi, and Sharjah.','<div class=\"space-y-8\">\n    <p class=\"text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-700 leading-relaxed font-normal\">\n        <strong>Rental Power UAE</strong> provides industry-leading <strong>air cooled chiller rental in the UAE</strong>, offering modular, high-efficiency screw and scroll liquid chillers ranging from <strong>50 TR to 500 TR</strong> per machine. Air-cooled chillers are the most widely deployed temporary refrigeration solution across <a href=\"/locations/dubai\" class=\"text-amber-700 hover:text-amber-800 underline font-semibold\">Dubai</a>, <a href=\"/locations/abu-dhabi\" class=\"text-amber-700 hover:text-amber-800 underline font-semibold\">Abu Dhabi</a>, and <a href=\"/locations/sharjah\" class=\"text-amber-700 hover:text-amber-800 underline font-semibold\">Sharjah</a> due to their compact footprint, zero need for external cooling tower water, and instant plug-and-play hydronic commissioning.\n    </p>\n\n    <h2>1. Advantages of Air-Cooled Chiller Systems for UAE Rentals</h2>\n<figure class=\"my-8 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm border border-slate-200 not-prose bg-white\">\n    <img src=\"/storage/media/air-cooled-chiller-1.webp\" alt=\"Modular Air-Cooled Scroll Chiller\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"w-full h-auto object-cover max-h-[460px]\">\n    <figcaption class=\"p-3 bg-slate-50 text-center text-xs text-slate-600 font-medium border-t border-slate-100\">\n        Compact modular chiller installation with Blygold anti-corrosion condenser coil treatment.\n    </figcaption>\n</figure>\n\n    <p>\n        When faced with emergency HVAC downtime or temporary cooling requirements during municipal water supply restrictions, air-cooled chillers deliver unmatched operational flexibility:\n    </p>\n    <ul>\n        <li><strong>No External Water Supply Required:</strong> Unlike water-cooled systems that consume thousands of gallons of continuous makeup water and require chemical biocidal water treatment, air-cooled chillers reject heat directly into ambient air using high-efficiency axial fans.</li>\n        <li><strong>Rapid Rooftop & Grade Placement:</strong> Built on heavy-duty structural steel skid frames with crane lifting lugs and fork pockets, allowing swift positioning on parking lots, service alleyways, or commercial tower mechanical plant roofs.</li>\n        <li><strong>Zero Cooling Tower Maintenance:</strong> Completely eliminates risks of Legionella bacteria, cooling tower blowdown disposal issues, and cooling tower fill fouling from desert dust storms.</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <h3>Air-Cooled Chiller Engineering Specifications</h3>\n    <div class=\"overflow-x-auto my-6 not-prose\">\n        <table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-sm border-collapse border border-slate-200 rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-xs\">\n            <thead class=\"bg-slate-900 text-white font-bold uppercase text-[11px] tracking-wider\">\n                <tr>\n                    <th class=\"p-3 border border-slate-800\">Chiller Tonnage</th>\n                    <th class=\"p-3 border border-slate-800\">Nominal Cooling kW</th>\n                    <th class=\"p-3 border border-slate-800\">Chilled Water Flow (GPM)</th>\n                    <th class=\"p-3 border border-slate-800\">EER / COP Rating</th>\n                    <th class=\"p-3 border border-slate-800\">Refrigerant Type</th>\n                    <th class=\"p-3 border border-slate-800\">Sound Level (dBA @ 10m)</th>\n                </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody class=\"divide-y divide-slate-100 bg-white\">\n                <tr class=\"hover:bg-slate-50\">\n                    <td class=\"p-3 font-bold text-slate-900\">50 TR Air-Cooled</td>\n                    <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-700\">175 kW</td>\n                    <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-700\">120 GPM</td>\n                    <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-600\">9.8 EER (2.87 COP)</td>\n                    <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-600\">R410A Dual Circuit</td>\n                    <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-600\">68 dBA</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr class=\"hover:bg-slate-50 bg-slate-50/50\">\n                    <td class=\"p-3 font-bold text-slate-900\">100 TR Air-Cooled</td>\n                    <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-700\">350 kW</td>\n                    <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-700\">240 GPM</td>\n                    <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-600\">10.2 EER (2.98 COP)</td>\n                    <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-600\">R134a Semi-Hermetic</td>\n                    <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-600\">70 dBA</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr class=\"hover:bg-slate-50\">\n                    <td class=\"p-3 font-bold text-slate-900\">200 TR Air-Cooled</td>\n                    <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-700\">703 kW</td>\n                    <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-700\">480 GPM</td>\n                    <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-600\">10.8 EER (3.16 COP)</td>\n                    <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-600\">R134a Twin Screw</td>\n                    <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-600\">72 dBA</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr class=\"hover:bg-slate-50 bg-slate-50/50\">\n                    <td class=\"p-3 font-bold text-slate-900\">400 TR Modular Air-Cooled</td>\n                    <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-700\">1,406 kW</td>\n                    <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-700\">960 GPM</td>\n                    <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-600\">11.1 EER (3.25 COP)</td>\n                    <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-600\">R134a Multi-Circuit</td>\n                    <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-600\">74 dBA</td>\n                </tr>\n            </tbody>\n        </table>\n    </div>\n\n    <h2>2. High-Ambient V-Bank Condenser Design & Coating Technology</h2>\n    <p>\n        The relentless heat and airborne salt along the Arabian Gulf coastline cause severe galvanic corrosion and premature condenser tube pitting on standard rental equipment.\n    </p>\n    <p>\n        Our entire air-cooled chiller fleet utilizes:\n    </p>\n    <ul>\n        <li><strong>V-Angle Condenser Banks:</strong> Engineered for optimized aerodynamic airflow and reduced fan power consumption, maximizing cooling performance in confined spaces.</li>\n        <li><strong>Blygold & ElectroFin E-Coating:</strong> Complete polyurethane immersion coatings on aluminum fins and copper tubes, passing 10,000-hour ASTM B117 salt spray corrosion tests.</li>\n        <li><strong>Variable-Speed EC Condenser Fans:</strong> Inverter-driven axial fans modulate speed automatically based on condensing pressure, saving up to 25% electrical energy during night operations.</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <h2>3. Complete Turnkey Ancillary Packages</h2>\n    <p>\n        Rental Power UAE supplies a complete, unified hydronic and electrical ecosystem with every air-cooled chiller hire:\n    </p>\n    <ul>\n        <li><strong>Quick-Connect Food-Grade Chilled Water Hoses:</strong> 3-inch, 4-inch, 6-inch, and 8-inch flexible hoses equipped with Bauer or Camlock couplings rated for 150 PSI working pressure.</li>\n        <li><strong>VFD Dual Booster Pump Skids:</strong> High-efficiency centrifugal pumps featuring Danfoss or ABB frequency drives for precision pressure control.</li>\n        <li><strong>Automatic Bypass & Expansion Tanks:</strong> Prevent hydronic pressure surges and maintain closed-loop water stability.</li>\n        <li><strong>Integrated Power Generation:</strong> When local utility supplies are inadequate, we bundle the chiller with our synchronized <a href=\"/service/rental-generator-in-uae\">rental generators</a>.</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <h2>4. Competitor Benchmarking: Rental Power UAE vs. Aggreko & Byrne</h2>\n    <p>\n        Major regional plant hire providers frequently impose complicated billing models and slow dispatch windows. Rental Power UAE stands apart:\n    </p>\n    <ul>\n        <li><strong>Guaranteed Emergency Dispatch Under 90 Minutes:</strong> Logistics yards located strategically in Dubai, Abu Dhabi, and Sharjah ensure immediate dispatch with crane flatbeds on standby 24/7.</li>\n        <li><strong>Transparent Itemized Quotations:</strong> Zero hidden surprise charges for hose hire, camlock fittings, or weekend mobilization.</li>\n        <li><strong>Comprehensive Preventive Maintenance:</strong> Our mobile technicians perform routine oil analysis, refrigerant pressure checks, and coil washdowns every 250 operating hours at zero additional cost. Explore our <a href=\"/service/chiller-maintenance\">chiller maintenance services</a>.</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <h2>5. Frequently Asked Questions (Air-Cooled Chiller Hire)</h2>\n\n    <h3>What leaving water temperature (LWT) can your air-cooled chillers achieve?</h3>\n    <p>\n        Our standard comfort cooling chillers deliver chilled water between +5°C and +12°C. For industrial process and food refrigeration applications, we supply low-temperature models operating down to -10°C utilizing water-glycol mixtures.\n    </p>\n\n    <h3>Can multiple air-cooled chillers be connected together for larger projects?</h3>\n    <p>\n        Yes. Our modular hydronic headers and master-slave digital controllers allow us to parallel two, three, or up to ten chillers, creating multi-megawatt cooling stations scaling to 2,000+ TR with automated load sequencing and N+1 redundancy.\n    </p>\n\n    <h3>What clearance is required around an air-cooled chiller?</h3>\n    <p>\n        To ensure unobstructed condenser airflow and prevent hot air recirculation, we recommend a minimum clearance of 1.5 to 2.0 meters on all sides and unobstructed open sky above the fan discharge.\n    </p>\n\n    <h2>Hire an Air-Cooled Chiller in the UAE Today</h2>\n    <p>\n        Contact our specialized HVAC engineering desk at <strong>+971 56 921 3754</strong> or submit your site details via our <a href=\"/contact-us\">rapid quotation portal</a> for immediate engineering sizing and commercial terms.\n    </p>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"my-8 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm border border-slate-200 not-prose bg-white\">\n    <img src=\"/storage/media/chiller-rental-service.webp\" alt=\"High-Ambient Screw Air-Cooled Chiller\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"w-full h-auto object-cover max-h-[460px]\">\n    <figcaption class=\"p-3 bg-slate-50 text-center text-xs text-slate-600 font-medium border-t border-slate-100\">\n        Dual-circuit air-cooled chiller package operating at 100% capacity in extreme heat.\n    </figcaption>\n</figure>',NULL,NULL,NULL,'storage/media/air-cooled-chiller.webp','published',0,1,'air cooled chiller rental uae','Air Cooled Chiller Rental UAE | 50–500 TR Industrial Chillers Dubai','Air cooled chiller rental in UAE: 50 TR to 500 TR high-ambient industrial screw chillers across Dubai, Abu Dhabi & Sharjah. Plug-and-play chilled water with 24/7 support.','Air Cooled Chiller Rental UAE, temporary cooling uae, rental chiller dubai, packaged ac rental uae, rental power uae',NULL,NULL,NULL,'storage/media/air-cooled-chiller.webp',1,91,100,'2026-10-18 22:52:33','2026-10-19 10:22:37',NULL),(58,'Rental Power in UAE','rental-power-in-uae','Turnkey Rental Power Solutions & Multi-Megawatt Temporary Power Plants Across UAE','Prime & Standby Power • 20 kVA to 50 MW Synchronized Plants','sparkles','Turnkey rental power in UAE across Dubai, Abu Dhabi, and Sharjah. Supplying prime and standby diesel generators, synchronizing panels, step-up transformers (11kV/33kV), and multi-megawatt temporary power stations with 24/7 technical monitoring.','<div class=\"space-y-8\">\n    <p class=\"text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-700 leading-relaxed font-normal\">\n        <strong>Rental Power UAE</strong> is the leading turnkey provider of <strong>rental power in the UAE</strong>, engineering, mobilizing, and operating temporary electrical generation packages scaling from <strong>20 kVA portable units up to 50 MW synchronized power stations</strong>. From massive infrastructure projects in <a href=\"/locations/dubai\" class=\"text-amber-700 hover:text-amber-800 underline font-semibold\">Dubai</a> and oilfield operations across <a href=\"/locations/abu-dhabi\" class=\"text-amber-700 hover:text-amber-800 underline font-semibold\">Abu Dhabi</a> to manufacturing plants in <a href=\"/locations/sharjah\" class=\"text-amber-700 hover:text-amber-800 underline font-semibold\">